(2344352, 326481, 39349, '<td valign="top">I really feel you have a great potential for a stunning shot here. The thing that is really turning me off though is the green background, it makes the purple seem too flat. I would suggest sniping this little guy and putting it in front of a white, black or even yellow background and you''d have an explosive image. I give this a 6.</td>', 'I really feel you have a great potential for a stunning shot here. The thing that is really turning me off though is the green background, it makes the purple seem too flat. I would suggest sniping this little guy and putting it in front of a white, black or even yellow background and you''d have an explosive image. I give this a 6.', '2006-04-26 02:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2344354, 326028, 1, '<td valign="top">The flowers unfortunately lack the detail required to really pull this type of shot off.</td>', 'The flowers unfortunately lack the detail required to really pull this type of shot off.', '2006-04-26 02:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
