(2344634, 326345, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice, but might be better if rotated 90° clockwise and then flipped horizontally</td>', 'nice, but might be better if rotated 90° clockwise and then flipped horizontally', '2006-04-26 05:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2344648, 325478, 24870, '<td valign="top">Good idea! Could be sharper, and I feel the plate is a little distracting to me. Either see most or all of the plate, or leave it out. I definately feel like I want to see more of the apple.</td>', 'Good idea! Could be sharper, and I feel the plate is a little distracting to me. Either see most or all of the plate, or leave it out. I definately feel like I want to see more of the apple.', '2006-04-26 05:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2344662, 326571, 24870, '<td valign="top">Cliche allright! Still, good idea. The fish is a great focus point, but the  light on the bottom right of the glass snatches my attention away. Perhaps with a smaller aperture the depth of field would be increased, and the edges of the glass would be in focus too.  A black background behind the camera may have removed the reflections in the glass, and the little something at the bottom of the glass caught my eye (fish food?). Good photo!</td>', 'Cliche allright! Still, good idea. The fish is a great focus point, but the  light on the bottom right of the glass snatches my attention away. Perhaps with a smaller aperture the depth of field would be increased, and the edges of the glass would be in focus too.  A black background behind the camera may have removed the reflections in the glass, and the little something at the bottom of the glass caught my eye (fish food?). Good photo!', '2006-04-26 05:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2344668, 325203, 9668, '<td valign="top">Intriguing photos. Looks like some kind of elaborate dress. Love how the focus is immediatly on the yellow, than it drifts around to see all the blue in the image. I think a deeper DOF (depth of field, which is achieved by shooting with a smaller aperture) would have helped bring more into focus. It looks a little grainy, maybe upgrade your camera ;).</td>', 'Intriguing photos. Looks like some kind of elaborate dress. Love how the focus is immediatly on the yellow, than it drifts around to see all the blue in the image. I think a deeper DOF (depth of field, which is achieved by shooting with a smaller aperture) would have helped bring more into focus. It looks a little grainy, maybe upgrade your camera ;).', '2006-04-26 05:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2344674, 326465, 34938, '<td valign="top">very nice...would have liked the whole branch sharp, but that''s minor...great colours</td>', 'very nice...would have liked the whole branch sharp, but that''s minor...great colours', '2006-04-26 05:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
