(2345028, 324237, 34938, '<td valign="top">I was going to say, on first look, this is way oversharpened, but on a closer inspection I think it suits the shot...only distraction is the shadow...if you pulled back the flower the background would have been out of focus enough to eliminate that...I like it 7</td>', 'I was going to say, on first look, this is way oversharpened, but on a closer inspection I think it suits the shot...only distraction is the shadow...if you pulled back the flower the background would have been out of focus enough to eliminate that...I like it 7', '2006-04-26 07:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
