(2345062, 325203, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good potential here.  Looks like a vase of flowers, for this Challenge, concentrating just on the iris with the complementary scheme of purple/blue and yellow/orange (tweaking in pp to get one or the other), a different angle, eliminating the other detracting flowers and colors and a variation in composition, make this better in my opinion.  Looks blown and ''too close'' focal-wise as well.  Shame about the dead pixel and grain, again, varying the composition and/or crop, likely have helped this.</td>', '3 - Good potential here.  Looks like a vase of flowers, for this Challenge, concentrating just on the iris with the complementary scheme of purple/blue and yellow/orange (tweaking in pp to get one or the other), a different angle, eliminating the other detracting flowers and colors and a variation in composition, make this better in my opinion.  Looks blown and ''too close'' focal-wise as well.  Shame about the dead pixel and grain, again, varying the composition and/or crop, likely have helped this.', '2006-04-26 07:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
