(2345106, 325101, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Nice concept.  The ''top'' is a little distracting/detracts in my opinion, so if this is all you had to work with, perhaps cropping at the top to just get rid of it may have given this extra.  Lighting seems a little harsh, which makes me think ''flash'', so perhaps a little diffusion or ''further back'', who knows.  Not sure on the frame, although I can see you''ve gone to trouble with it, just think the colors do not enhance the subject as well as perhaps more subtle ones may have.</td>', '4 - Nice concept.  The ''top'' is a little distracting/detracts in my opinion, so if this is all you had to work with, perhaps cropping at the top to just get rid of it may have given this extra.  Lighting seems a little harsh, which makes me think ''flash'', so perhaps a little diffusion or ''further back'', who knows.  Not sure on the frame, although I can see you''ve gone to trouble with it, just think the colors do not enhance the subject as well as perhaps more subtle ones may have.', '2006-04-26 07:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
