(2345114, 326095, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Don''t mind the concept.  More detail in the fabrics and less on the skin, more blue incorporated/more vivid, make this better in my opinion.  The hair detracts.  Eye/eyes have potential, which I don''t think has been captured.  A more finely tuned crop/composition, especially top right corner (more or less) also likely have helped this.</td>', '4 - Don''t mind the concept.  More detail in the fabrics and less on the skin, more blue incorporated/more vivid, make this better in my opinion.  The hair detracts.  Eye/eyes have potential, which I don''t think has been captured.  A more finely tuned crop/composition, especially top right corner (more or less) also likely have helped this.', '2006-04-26 07:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
