(2346939, 324109, 16402, '<td valign="top">I like it. Made me think of the Denver Bronco immediately for some reason and since they are MY team, you get an extra point. I like the simple but creative approach to the challenge. I''d have liked to see the DOF extended to get paint at bottom in sharp focus, but that''s a minor detail.</td>', 'I like it. Made me think of the Denver Bronco immediately for some reason and since they are MY team, you get an extra point. I like the simple but creative approach to the challenge. I''d have liked to see the DOF extended to get paint at bottom in sharp focus, but that''s a minor detail.', '2006-04-26 15:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
