(2347726, 326018, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the colors.  Better ''symmetry'' and balance, ''ironing'' of the ribbons, would have made this better in my opinion.  Harder to read the third ''label'', perhaps because of harsh lighting/flash.  Ultimately, unless you do something really unusual with this, in my opinion, this shot is going to be a colorful shot of four bird show ribbons... which for the viewer does not mean the same as likely does for you.</td>', '4 - Like the colors.  Better ''symmetry'' and balance, ''ironing'' of the ribbons, would have made this better in my opinion.  Harder to read the third ''label'', perhaps because of harsh lighting/flash.  Ultimately, unless you do something really unusual with this, in my opinion, this shot is going to be a colorful shot of four bird show ribbons... which for the viewer does not mean the same as likely does for you.', '2006-04-26 19:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347728, 324666, 70, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''d love this shot if it weren''t for the yellow flower. The purple (although they look blue on my screen) flowers are so delicate and simple and I like how they look against the background but the yellow flower feels big and bulky and like it''s intruding on the scene. Good detail in the yellow flower, though.</td>', 'I feel like I''d love this shot if it weren''t for the yellow flower. The purple (although they look blue on my screen) flowers are so delicate and simple and I like how they look against the background but the yellow flower feels big and bulky and like it''s intruding on the scene. Good detail in the yellow flower, though.', '2006-04-26 19:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347730, 324582, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like the concept.  Tweaking of the colors/contrast and a crop variation, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Like the concept.  Tweaking of the colors/contrast and a crop variation, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 19:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347731, 324236, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but the colours aren''t popping... a bit more saturation would help this (maybe). Other than that, nice composition.</td>', 'Nice shot, but the colours aren''t popping... a bit more saturation would help this (maybe). Other than that, nice composition.', '2006-04-26 19:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347733, 324898, 70, '<td valign="top">I think this was a good idea that unfortunately ended up rather messy looking. Lacking in contrast and rather soft.</td>', 'I think this was a good idea that unfortunately ended up rather messy looking. Lacking in contrast and rather soft.', '2006-04-26 19:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347735, 326110, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Not abstract enough in my opinion - looks like handles rather than ''shapes'', if that makes sense.  Perhaps a variation in the lighting or something pp may have given this a little extra, who knows.</td>', '3 - Not abstract enough in my opinion - looks like handles rather than ''shapes'', if that makes sense.  Perhaps a variation in the lighting or something pp may have given this a little extra, who knows.', '2006-04-26 19:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347736, 326515, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice flower shot, but where are the complimentary colours?</td>', 'Nice flower shot, but where are the complimentary colours?', '2006-04-26 19:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347738, 326492, 70, '<td valign="top">This is interesting. Nice detail and texture in the foreground. I''m guessing maybe that''s purple in the very back but the overall picture doesn''t strike me as especially representative of complementary colors.</td>', 'This is interesting. Nice detail and texture in the foreground. I''m guessing maybe that''s purple in the very back but the overall picture doesn''t strike me as especially representative of complementary colors.', '2006-04-26 19:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347739, 326593, 46648, '<td valign="top">that makes me pretty thirsty.....</td>', 'that makes me pretty thirsty.....', '2006-04-26 19:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347741, 326580, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice. A bit to symmetrical for me, but nice, and I can see this was a lot of trouble... did you wear gloves? :-)</td>', 'Nice. A bit to symmetrical for me, but nice, and I can see this was a lot of trouble... did you wear gloves? :-)', '2006-04-26 19:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347743, 326475, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - For the creativity and concept.  Like the matt of the orange but not sure it is overall balanced with the wooden(?) surface.  The orange is a little harsh or ''something'' pp perhaps, and detracts in myopinion.  Perhaps a variation in the direction the orange is facing, variation in lighting and as mentioned, not so ''harsh''/bit more texture coming through, made this better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - For the creativity and concept.  Like the matt of the orange but not sure it is overall balanced with the wooden(?) surface.  The orange is a little harsh or ''something'' pp perhaps, and detracts in myopinion.  Perhaps a variation in the direction the orange is facing, variation in lighting and as mentioned, not so ''harsh''/bit more texture coming through, made this better in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 19:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347744, 324016, 70, '<td valign="top">Composition feels a little unsettling here - very choppy. Overall photo seems underexposed and a bit soft.</td>', 'Composition feels a little unsettling here - very choppy. Overall photo seems underexposed and a bit soft.', '2006-04-26 19:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347747, 324957, 5728, '<td valign="top">Love M&amp;M''s! Cool with the shallow DOF, but I wish I could read what is on the plastic bottle, although not too problematic :)</td>', 'Love M&M''s! Cool with the shallow DOF, but I wish I could read what is on the plastic bottle, although not too problematic :)', '2006-04-26 19:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347748, 324143, 41554, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but the colours aren''t very exciting. A bit more saturation could have helped make them pop.</td>', 'Not bad, but the colours aren''t very exciting. A bit more saturation could have helped make them pop.', '2006-04-26 19:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347751, 324929, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good potential.  Not sure that you''ve ''used'' the blue/orange color scheme available here to its best, perhaps a sharper angle, more refined crop, more attention paid to what is in the reflection and more ''blue'' from the reflection, may have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Good potential.  Not sure that you''ve ''used'' the blue/orange color scheme available here to its best, perhaps a sharper angle, more refined crop, more attention paid to what is in the reflection and more ''blue'' from the reflection, may have made this better in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 19:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347752, 326080, 70, '<td valign="top">Great detail and colors. The..umm...yellow thingy (darn grade school science, where are you?!) seems like it could use a touch more focus/sharpness.</td>', 'Great detail and colors. The..umm...yellow thingy (darn grade school science, where are you?!) seems like it could use a touch more focus/sharpness.', '2006-04-26 19:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347753, 324109, 46648, '<td valign="top">i wish it was in focus at the bottom</td>', 'i wish it was in focus at the bottom', '2006-04-26 19:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347755, 324544, 70, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene but doesn''t seem especially representative of complementary colors.</td>', 'Beautiful scene but doesn''t seem especially representative of complementary colors.', '2006-04-26 19:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347756, 324509, 41554, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm strawberries. Cream... must... resist.... mmmm.....<br/>Maybe this would work better with ripe strawberries which are of a more intense red. Also the light (flash?) reflection is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Mmmmm strawberries. Cream... must... resist.... mmmm.....Maybe this would work better with ripe strawberries which are of a more intense red. Also the light (flash?) reflection is a bit distracting.', '2006-04-26 19:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347758, 323929, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Don''t mind the concept, although can''t work out how the flower got there/got like that, doesn''t ''enhance'' the image, in my opinion.  Overall a bit dark, perhaps if the blue in the darker areas came through more, may have given this a little extra in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Don''t mind the concept, although can''t work out how the flower got there/got like that, doesn''t ''enhance'' the image, in my opinion.  Overall a bit dark, perhaps if the blue in the darker areas came through more, may have given this a little extra in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 19:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347760, 323596, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - This seems a victim of ''camera shake'' and possibly pixelation issues pp, not sure.  Sharper focus, variation in crop and composition, likely have helped this in my opinion.</td>', '3 - This seems a victim of ''camera shake'' and possibly pixelation issues pp, not sure.  Sharper focus, variation in crop and composition, likely have helped this in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 19:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347761, 325386, 41554, '<td valign="top">Great. Very creative and true to the challenge. I might have considered just the window and a bit of the wooden wall.</td>', 'Great. Very creative and true to the challenge. I might have considered just the window and a bit of the wooden wall.', '2006-04-26 19:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347763, 326144, 70, '<td valign="top">Could use sharper focus but nicely composed.</td>', 'Could use sharper focus but nicely composed.', '2006-04-26 19:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347764, 325745, 46648, '<td valign="top">cool idea</td>', 'cool idea', '2006-04-26 19:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347771, 324629, 70, '<td valign="top">These seem a little pink for complementary colors. Nice shot, though and excellent crispness on the flowers.</td>', 'These seem a little pink for complementary colors. Nice shot, though and excellent crispness on the flowers.', '2006-04-26 19:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347772, 323635, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Looks like good potential.  Sharper focus, bigger (640 width), more control of the reds, a slight variation in angle/composition (allowing in more green and the petal ''chops'' at more strategic places), make this better in my opinion.  Also looks like you may have some pixelation/resizing/jpeg issues, not sure.  Like to see the detail in the petal ruffles/crimping etc, which has not been captured, in my opinion.</td>', '2 - Looks like good potential.  Sharper focus, bigger (640 width), more control of the reds, a slight variation in angle/composition (allowing in more green and the petal ''chops'' at more strategic places), make this better in my opinion.  Also looks like you may have some pixelation/resizing/jpeg issues, not sure.  Like to see the detail in the petal ruffles/crimping etc, which has not been captured, in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 19:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347773, 324999, 46648, '<td valign="top">that''s pretty freakin cool. but i think i might have like this better with the whole glass in it.</td>', 'that''s pretty freakin cool. but i think i might have like this better with the whole glass in it.', '2006-04-26 19:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347780, 325088, 70, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! A bit too much glare but good lord, lighting reflective things is such a pain that I definitely understand. The lighting otherwise is very nice.</td>', 'Nicely done! A bit too much glare but good lord, lighting reflective things is such a pain that I definitely understand. The lighting otherwise is very nice.', '2006-04-26 19:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347782, 326495, 46648, '<td valign="top">that''s awesome</td>', 'that''s awesome', '2006-04-26 19:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347793, 326143, 70, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Underexposed and lacking in contrast, though.</td>', 'Cute idea. Underexposed and lacking in contrast, though.', '2006-04-26 19:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347798, 326083, 46648, '<td valign="top">i''ve ridden that roller coaster...and it is sooooooo awesome</td>', 'i''ve ridden that roller coaster...and it is sooooooo awesome', '2006-04-26 19:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347799, 326356, 70, '<td valign="top">I''m interested to know what this is. It looks like a photo of a picture. The colors are definitely complementary but the harsh pixelation of the photo hurts it quite a bit.</td>', 'I''m interested to know what this is. It looks like a photo of a picture. The colors are definitely complementary but the harsh pixelation of the photo hurts it quite a bit.', '2006-04-26 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347806, 325381, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Meets the Challenge and simple enough.  Needs more depth and a variation in lighting in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Meets the Challenge and simple enough.  Needs more depth and a variation in lighting in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 19:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347809, 326495, 5885, '<td valign="top">That''s either a small lizard or a HUGE bell pepper :-) Nice shot of this the little guy.</td>', 'That''s either a small lizard or a HUGE bell pepper :-) Nice shot of this the little guy.', '2006-04-26 19:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347810, 324452, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Bit too subtle for me.  Like the concept though, but for this Challenge like to see ''somehow'' those colors more dominant, which given the size of the color scheme here and the size of the main subject, would be pretty tricky.</td>', '5 - Bit too subtle for me.  Like the concept though, but for this Challenge like to see ''somehow'' those colors more dominant, which given the size of the color scheme here and the size of the main subject, would be pretty tricky.', '2006-04-26 19:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347816, 325604, 5885, '<td valign="top">This is a bit over-saturated for my taste.</td>', 'This is a bit over-saturated for my taste.', '2006-04-26 19:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347823, 326423, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good potential.  Not sure which scheme you were going for here.  I see primarily orange, green and then ''purple'', with tiny hints of yellow.  Going for either a different angle, using the purple petals more and gaining the yellow, otherwise much tighter and adjusting the hue and using the red/green for the color scheme, not sure.  Variation in the composition to gain a little more balance too, plus bigger (640).</td>', '3 - Good potential.  Not sure which scheme you were going for here.  I see primarily orange, green and then ''purple'', with tiny hints of yellow.  Going for either a different angle, using the purple petals more and gaining the yellow, otherwise much tighter and adjusting the hue and using the red/green for the color scheme, not sure.  Variation in the composition to gain a little more balance too, plus bigger (640).', '2006-04-26 19:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347826, 325980, 5885, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2006-04-26 19:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347827, 326150, 5885, '<td valign="top">The red ones are yummy, the green ones are ok. I really like the clear ones ;-)<br/> <br/>I wish you had filled in the white spots in this image with more green gummy bears. They just kinda draw my eye there. Also, focus is a bit soft.</td>', 'The red ones are yummy, the green ones are ok. I really like the clear ones ;-) I wish you had filled in the white spots in this image with more green gummy bears. They just kinda draw my eye there. Also, focus is a bit soft.', '2006-04-26 19:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347828, 326409, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Looks  like this was taken outside - perhaps incorporating more of the blue of the sky might have given this a little extra.  Fairly minor, but not sure the hand is enhancing this image, in my opinion - but depends what you were going for.  Like the effect of the balloons OOF, perhaps ''using'' that more, depending on what opportunities you had, of course.  Just not holding my interest.</td>', '4 - Looks  like this was taken outside - perhaps incorporating more of the blue of the sky might have given this a little extra.  Fairly minor, but not sure the hand is enhancing this image, in my opinion - but depends what you were going for.  Like the effect of the balloons OOF, perhaps ''using'' that more, depending on what opportunities you had, of course.  Just not holding my interest.', '2006-04-26 19:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347835, 326489, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good potential.  Less greeen, variation in angle, composition and focal point(s), make this better in my opinion.  Some of the colors look ''blown''.  Also, I see blue/yellow and purple/orange here, so concentrating on one or ther other and slightly adjusting the hue if necessary also.  Frame detracts, especially for this Challenge, in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Good potential.  Less greeen, variation in angle, composition and focal point(s), make this better in my opinion.  Some of the colors look ''blown''.  Also, I see blue/yellow and purple/orange here, so concentrating on one or ther other and slightly adjusting the hue if necessary also.  Frame detracts, especially for this Challenge, in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 19:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347837, 326095, 49773, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t do much for me (within the challenge)as it looks like it''s been forced to be complementary. Nice portrait btw and excellent colors and composition.</td>', 'This doesn''t do much for me (within the challenge)as it looks like it''s been forced to be complementary. Nice portrait btw and excellent colors and composition.', '2006-04-26 19:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347839, 325813, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Too subtle for me - colors.  Fairly good shot of the moon and star, but does have somewhat of a ''snapshottish'' type of feel to it.  Composition is good.  Tweaking of the colors (although realize likely blow out the moon/star), for this Challenge, may have helped.  640 width too.</td>', '3 - Too subtle for me - colors.  Fairly good shot of the moon and star, but does have somewhat of a ''snapshottish'' type of feel to it.  Composition is good.  Tweaking of the colors (although realize likely blow out the moon/star), for this Challenge, may have helped.  640 width too.', '2006-04-26 19:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347841, 326076, 49773, '<td valign="top">Too many colours for my taste.</td>', 'Too many colours for my taste.', '2006-04-26 19:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347845, 324586, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice colors.  Good execution and refraction and symmetry.  Fairly minor and nothing to be done likely in basic anyway, but the ''someting'' in the right glass up near the rim detracts in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Nice colors.  Good execution and refraction and symmetry.  Fairly minor and nothing to be done likely in basic anyway, but the ''someting'' in the right glass up near the rim detracts in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 19:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347848, 326497, 49773, '<td valign="top">Great macro but red is not that apparent/dominant as it should be.</td>', 'Great macro but red is not that apparent/dominant as it should be.', '2006-04-26 19:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347852, 326498, 49773, '<td valign="top">Very original. Very interesting. I like it .</td>', 'Very original. Very interesting. I like it .', '2006-04-26 19:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347854, 326038, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like this.  More finely tuned crop, especially at the bottom, more detail in the textures of the papers perhaps (as opposed to that purple ''base'') and a slight variation in composition, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Looks a little unbalanced overall.</td>', '6 - Like this.  More finely tuned crop, especially at the bottom, more detail in the textures of the papers perhaps (as opposed to that purple ''base'') and a slight variation in composition, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Looks a little unbalanced overall.', '2006-04-26 19:42:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2347865, 325881, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice, but would like to have seen some of the yellow in focus as well, perhaps a slightly different angle to showcase the two, not sure.  Difficult, but also ''less green''.  A slight variation in composition - more off-centered, or otherwise more centered, may have also given this a little extra, not sure.  Looks like you tweaked the colors to get the hue right for the Challenge, if so, seems quite well done.</td>', '5 - Nice, but would like to have seen some of the yellow in focus as well, perhaps a slightly different angle to showcase the two, not sure.  Difficult, but also ''less green''.  A slight variation in composition - more off-centered, or otherwise more centered, may have also given this a little extra, not sure.  Looks like you tweaked the colors to get the hue right for the Challenge, if so, seems quite well done.', '2006-04-26 19:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347868, 326488, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Think perhaps if you went for an unusual perspective using this vehicle, may have given this extra in my opinion.  Also trying to not get your reflection in shot, unless that was intentional.</td>', '4 - Think perhaps if you went for an unusual perspective using this vehicle, may have given this extra in my opinion.  Also trying to not get your reflection in shot, unless that was intentional.', '2006-04-26 19:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347872, 325241, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Looks a little too close and like it needs a wash.  Variation in cropping also have helped this in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Looks a little too close and like it needs a wash.  Variation in cropping also have helped this in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 19:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347881, 325966, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the concept, composition and detail in the star.  The ''orange'' (which looks like you''ve tried pp to tweak) not working in my opinion.  The pebbles also look a little grainy or ''something''.</td>', '4 - Like the concept, composition and detail in the star.  The ''orange'' (which looks like you''ve tried pp to tweak) not working in my opinion.  The pebbles also look a little grainy or ''something''.', '2006-04-26 19:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347882, 325204, 57659, '<td valign="top">Like the sense of motion in the blue</td>', 'Like the sense of motion in the blue', '2006-04-26 19:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347884, 326579, 57659, '<td valign="top">Nice seperation from the background</td>', 'Nice seperation from the background', '2006-04-26 19:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347886, 325081, 57659, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal lines</td>', 'I like the diagonal lines', '2006-04-26 19:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347887, 326096, 57659, '<td valign="top">nice facial expressions. . .</td>', 'nice facial expressions. . .', '2006-04-26 19:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347890, 323735, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential.  More detail in the color and petals, perhaps the focal point just a fraction further forward and possibly use of tripod (apologies in advance if you used one), a more refined crop, especially on the right, and a tweaking of the colors (difficult with reds) make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Good potential.  More detail in the color and petals, perhaps the focal point just a fraction further forward and possibly use of tripod (apologies in advance if you used one), a more refined crop, especially on the right, and a tweaking of the colors (difficult with reds) make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 19:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347896, 323952, 57659, '<td valign="top">I would enjoy this more if the colors were more vibrant</td>', 'I would enjoy this more if the colors were more vibrant', '2006-04-26 20:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347898, 323351, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Potential looks like it is there.  Bigger (640 height), variation in lighting, sharper focus, more depth and better control of the reds make this much better in my opinion.  Background is grainy and also dominates too much in this shot.  Like to see the detail in the flower and petals and more leaves/green incorporated too.  Composition is quite good.  Up to 3 from 2, because it looks like you put some though into the arrangement/composition and framing.</td>', '3 - Potential looks like it is there.  Bigger (640 height), variation in lighting, sharper focus, more depth and better control of the reds make this much better in my opinion.  Background is grainy and also dominates too much in this shot.  Like to see the detail in the flower and petals and more leaves/green incorporated too.  Composition is quite good.  Up to 3 from 2, because it looks like you put some though into the arrangement/composition and framing.', '2006-04-26 20:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347899, 326439, 57659, '<td valign="top">Great idea</td>', 'Great idea', '2006-04-26 20:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347900, 324633, 49773, '<td valign="top">I think people will complain about this one but it''s excellent in my opinion.</td>', 'I think people will complain about this one but it''s excellent in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 20:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347903, 326123, 57659, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell what the subject is here.</td>', 'It''s hard to tell what the subject is here.', '2006-04-26 20:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347906, 324898, 57659, '<td valign="top">funny, really enjoyed the laugh</td>', 'funny, really enjoyed the laugh', '2006-04-26 20:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347910, 326106, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites in the challenge, it''s really nice!</td>', 'One of my favourites in the challenge, it''s really nice!', '2006-04-26 20:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347911, 324465, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good potential, but this is coming across primarily more yellow than orange in my opinion.  Perhaps a hue adjustment would have helped.  Composition seems quite good, but perhaps a little more space on the left for more balance.  The focus a little further forward too perhaps.</td>', '3 - Good potential, but this is coming across primarily more yellow than orange in my opinion.  Perhaps a hue adjustment would have helped.  Composition seems quite good, but perhaps a little more space on the left for more balance.  The focus a little further forward too perhaps.', '2006-04-26 20:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347914, 324399, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Nice concept.  A litlte more detail discernable and variation in lighting (especially to reduce the blown areas), make this better in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Nice concept.  A litlte more detail discernable and variation in lighting (especially to reduce the blown areas), make this better in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 20:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347919, 326096, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - A little unusual, still needs some tweaking of the colors to make it more unusual in my opinion, and especially for this Challenge.  More balance, a more refined crop and the background ''blotches'' fixed, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - A little unusual, still needs some tweaking of the colors to make it more unusual in my opinion, and especially for this Challenge.  More balance, a more refined crop and the background ''blotches'' fixed, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 20:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347921, 326573, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Fairly clean.  Like to see the points dead on perhaps, more balance, not sure.</td>', '5 - Fairly clean.  Like to see the points dead on perhaps, more balance, not sure.', '2006-04-26 20:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
