(2347939, 326448, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Simple enough, but in my opinion the choice of bowl and also surface compete too much for attention away from your main subjects and therefore detract, especially from the color scheme, in my opinion.  Also the choice of apple and tomato together would have to be a special and unusual shot to work, in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Simple enough, but in my opinion the choice of bowl and also surface compete too much for attention away from your main subjects and therefore detract, especially from the color scheme, in my opinion.  Also the choice of apple and tomato together would have to be a special and unusual shot to work, in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 20:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2347942, 326487, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice and simple, good composition and framing.  Like to see the red tweaked a little, especially for this Challenge.  Likely difficult, as looks like bordering on blown areas as is.</td>', '6 - Nice and simple, good composition and framing.  Like to see the red tweaked a little, especially for this Challenge.  Likely difficult, as looks like bordering on blown areas as is.', '2006-04-26 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
