(2348099, 324898, 39850, '<td valign="top">1 - With a stretch, I think I get your concept, but needs a lot of refinement to pull it off, in my opinion.  Angle, lighting, depth, textures, ''paint'', etc.. all need work.  Your concept, actually detracts from this shot, in my opinion.  Just the orange and the blueberries, with better focus and an adjustment in lighting, would have been better.  Looks ''snapshottish'', yet can see you''ve made some effort, just not very pleasing to the eye - again, in my opinion.</td>', '1 - With a stretch, I think I get your concept, but needs a lot of refinement to pull it off, in my opinion.  Angle, lighting, depth, textures, ''paint'', etc.. all need work.  Your concept, actually detracts from this shot, in my opinion.  Just the orange and the blueberries, with better focus and an adjustment in lighting, would have been better.  Looks ''snapshottish'', yet can see you''ve made some effort, just not very pleasing to the eye - again, in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 21:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
