(2348151, 325387, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - I''m seeing pink, green and yellow primarily in this shot.  Perhaps a ''birds eye'' view/angle and adjusting the hue pp to purple more, may have given this extra.  No idea on your title, but your call.</td>', '2 - I''m seeing pink, green and yellow primarily in this shot.  Perhaps a ''birds eye'' view/angle and adjusting the hue pp to purple more, may have given this extra.  No idea on your title, but your call.', '2006-04-26 21:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
