(2348166, 324424, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Bit of a stretch.  Would like to have seen the color schemes dominate in this shot, rather than the ball play.  Looks more orange to me - which would go well with the blue in the distance - but your call.</td>', '2 - Bit of a stretch.  Would like to have seen the color schemes dominate in this shot, rather than the ball play.  Looks more orange to me - which would go well with the blue in the distance - but your call.', '2006-04-26 21:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
