(2348332, 326515, 43901, '<td valign="top">I like the angle ... something in the background (right side) is distracting from the shot.</td>', 'I like the angle ... something in the background (right side) is distracting from the shot.', '2006-04-26 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348334, 326150, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Don''t mnd the concept but think needs a bit of work to achieve full potential.  Sharper focus, variation in angle and lighting and composition, all have helped this, in my opinion.  Just looks a bit ''snapshottish''.</td>', '2 - Don''t mnd the concept but think needs a bit of work to achieve full potential.  Sharper focus, variation in angle and lighting and composition, all have helped this, in my opinion.  Just looks a bit ''snapshottish''.', '2006-04-26 22:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348335, 325468, 43901, '<td valign="top">the stuff at the top left is distracting ... crop tigher on the red leaves</td>', 'the stuff at the top left is distracting ... crop tigher on the red leaves', '2006-04-26 22:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348338, 323440, 43901, '<td valign="top">OOF and blown out</td>', 'OOF and blown out', '2006-04-26 22:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348340, 324088, 41522, '<td valign="top">This is too small for me to be able to give it a proper rating.</td>', 'This is too small for me to be able to give it a proper rating.', '2006-04-26 22:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348341, 326217, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Unusual.  Wish it were 640.  Your call obviously, but wonder if a flip in ''some'' direction may have actually enhanced this.  Also, some areas seem a little ''blown'', the white background enhances that somewhat as well in my opinion.  Like to see sharper focus on all or ''key areas''.</td>', '6 - Unusual.  Wish it were 640.  Your call obviously, but wonder if a flip in ''some'' direction may have actually enhanced this.  Also, some areas seem a little ''blown'', the white background enhances that somewhat as well in my opinion.  Like to see sharper focus on all or ''key areas''.', '2006-04-26 22:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348349, 326148, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice.  The ''pollen spill'' is unusual.  The focus a little ''wider'' else the flower ''pushed back'' a little more, make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Nice.  The ''pollen spill'' is unusual.  The focus a little ''wider'' else the flower ''pushed back'' a little more, make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 22:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348354, 326553, 39850, '<td valign="top">1 - Hard stretch to see a color scheme here.  Not holding my attention otherwise.</td>', '1 - Hard stretch to see a color scheme here.  Not holding my attention otherwise.', '2006-04-26 22:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348359, 325449, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good.  Like the composition.  Difficult likely with resulting contrast issues, but if the colors could be tweaked a little to become a little richer (possibly also the bug ''redder''), make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Good.  Like the composition.  Difficult likely with resulting contrast issues, but if the colors could be tweaked a little to become a little richer (possibly also the bug ''redder''), make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 22:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348363, 326528, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Colors are nice.  Obviously dark overall but seems intentional.  Your title draws attention to whether this <i>is</i> symmetrical or not, and it is slightly off, but fairly minor.  Composition works well. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-04 15:56:10.</i></td>', '4 - Colors are nice.  Obviously dark overall but seems intentional.  Your title draws attention to whether this is symmetrical or not, and it is slightly off, but fairly minor.  Composition works well. edit:typo', '2006-04-26 22:07:52.000000', '2006-07-04 16:56:10.000000', 1),
(2348370, 326123, 41522, '<td valign="top">The first time I entered a comp. colours challenge, I didn''t pick colours that were opposites on a colour wheel (search complementary color on the net).  Even though there is a hint of green in this photo, it feels to me that you really didn''t intend for the green to be the complement of the red car.  Outside of the challenge, I think I would have liked a simpler composition ... maybe a shallower DOF to give the car more visual weight.  JMO.</td>', 'The first time I entered a comp. colours challenge, I didn''t pick colours that were opposites on a colour wheel (search complementary color on the net).  Even though there is a hint of green in this photo, it feels to me that you really didn''t intend for the green to be the complement of the red car.  Outside of the challenge, I think I would have liked a simpler composition ... maybe a shallower DOF to give the car more visual weight.  JMO.', '2006-04-26 22:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348371, 323952, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Like the concept, but struggling with the color scheme(s).  Tweaking of the colors - red/green and/or blue/orange, plus sharper focus, make this better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.</td>', '3 - Like the concept, but struggling with the color scheme(s).  Tweaking of the colors - red/green and/or blue/orange, plus sharper focus, make this better in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.', '2006-04-26 22:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348376, 326410, 41522, '<td valign="top">The photo is too small for me to properly rate.  From what I can see, the clutter overwhelms any complimentary colours that might be present.  JMO.</td>', 'The photo is too small for me to properly rate.  From what I can see, the clutter overwhelms any complimentary colours that might be present.  JMO.', '2006-04-26 22:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348380, 324109, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Meets the Challenge, just background is a little too bright in my opinion.  Also not holding my attention overall enough, especially for what seems to be an abstract.</td>', '3 - Meets the Challenge, just background is a little too bright in my opinion.  Also not holding my attention overall enough, especially for what seems to be an abstract.', '2006-04-26 22:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348381, 326374, 43901, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more DOF and perhaps a higher angle</td>', 'I would like to see more DOF and perhaps a higher angle', '2006-04-26 22:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348382, 324143, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Not bad for a dead/dying flower shot.  Like to see more green incorporated.</td>', '4 - Not bad for a dead/dying flower shot.  Like to see more green incorporated.', '2006-04-26 22:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348388, 326325, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice.  Variation in lighting (softer) and a little sharper make this better in my opinion.  Difficult, but perhaps a tighter crop too, trying to eliminate the ''other'' colors.</td>', '5 - Nice.  Variation in lighting (softer) and a little sharper make this better in my opinion.  Difficult, but perhaps a tighter crop too, trying to eliminate the ''other'' colors.', '2006-04-26 22:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348390, 325973, 70, '<td valign="top">It''s difficult to tell, with this, if you are making a statement with your border or using it to cover up portions of your photo that are best removed. While I can appreciate borders that aren''t "standard," this one isn''t really doing it for me. The colors of the photo look beautiful, though.</td>', 'It''s difficult to tell, with this, if you are making a statement with your border or using it to cover up portions of your photo that are best removed. While I can appreciate borders that aren''t "standard," this one isn''t really doing it for me. The colors of the photo look beautiful, though.', '2006-04-26 22:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348391, 326158, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Very hard pressed to find yellow here, but <i>do</i> like the concept and composition and colors, but they are not ''complementary''.  Bigger would have also helped you.</td>', '2 - Very hard pressed to find yellow here, but do like the concept and composition and colors, but they are not ''complementary''.  Bigger would have also helped you.', '2006-04-26 22:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348392, 326460, 70, '<td valign="top">Wow, such detail!</td>', 'Wow, such detail!', '2006-04-26 22:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348393, 326198, 46448, '<td valign="top">I really hope this one ribbons, I like every part about it, must of taken a few takes to get it worked out right. Great Job!</td>', 'I really hope this one ribbons, I like every part about it, must of taken a few takes to get it worked out right. Great Job!', '2006-04-26 22:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348394, 325973, 41522, '<td valign="top">The complimentary colours of green is red and I feel that the flower is too pink to really fit into the complementary colour category.  The photo itself looks to be good.  Also, I think that for DPC, the border is too much ... the photo becomes too small to properly judge although I think in print form, the border would probably look cool on a decent sized photo.  JMO</td>', 'The complimentary colours of green is red and I feel that the flower is too pink to really fit into the complementary colour category.  The photo itself looks to be good.  Also, I think that for DPC, the border is too much ... the photo becomes too small to properly judge although I think in print form, the border would probably look cool on a decent sized photo.  JMO', '2006-04-26 22:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348401, 323701, 70, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle use of the star filter here. There''s not much impact as far as complementary colors go, though.</td>', 'I like the subtle use of the star filter here. There''s not much impact as far as complementary colors go, though.', '2006-04-26 22:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348402, 325910, 20350, '<td valign="top">Great lines and contrast with the red and greens! Good Job!</td>', 'Great lines and contrast with the red and greens! Good Job!', '2006-04-26 22:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348405, 326591, 48228, '<td valign="top">Another great image here.....I really love these colors together.....</td>', 'Another great image here.....I really love these colors together.....', '2006-04-26 22:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348408, 326058, 70, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity here. Would make a good Christmas card. :)</td>', 'I really like the simplicity here. Would make a good Christmas card. :)', '2006-04-26 22:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348415, 325081, 70, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love this. Unique shapes and nice colors. The white part is moderately distracting but I don''t think there''s really anything that can be done about that.</td>', 'Wow, I love this. Unique shapes and nice colors. The white part is moderately distracting but I don''t think there''s really anything that can be done about that.', '2006-04-26 22:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348435, 326080, 48228, '<td valign="top">This works for me, as I like it.....</td>', 'This works for me, as I like it.....', '2006-04-26 22:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348438, 324798, 70, '<td valign="top">Interesting! I think I''d prefer it without the second, darker flower.</td>', 'Interesting! I think I''d prefer it without the second, darker flower.', '2006-04-26 22:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348447, 326489, 48228, '<td valign="top">One of the "best" in this challenge.....I love it, and I hope it wins a ribbon.....</td>', 'One of the "best" in this challenge.....I love it, and I hope it wins a ribbon.....', '2006-04-26 22:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348448, 326272, 70, '<td valign="top">I think maybe this would be improved by a tighter crop, removing the two flowers in the back.</td>', 'I think maybe this would be improved by a tighter crop, removing the two flowers in the back.', '2006-04-26 22:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348451, 326123, 70, '<td valign="top">Perhaps they do, but they don''t really satisfy a challenge on complementary colors. This is more of a snapshot.</td>', 'Perhaps they do, but they don''t really satisfy a challenge on complementary colors. This is more of a snapshot.', '2006-04-26 22:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348455, 326396, 70, '<td valign="top">Love this! Excellent bright colors, interesting composition, nice textures and a neat clip of a larger picture.</td>', 'Love this! Excellent bright colors, interesting composition, nice textures and a neat clip of a larger picture.', '2006-04-26 22:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348460, 325530, 70, '<td valign="top">A good idea. The background is rather distracting. I think maybe, in order to include the corks, a larger overall crop would work. As it is, it''s a little hard to look at all three subjects in the photo.</td>', 'A good idea. The background is rather distracting. I think maybe, in order to include the corks, a larger overall crop would work. As it is, it''s a little hard to look at all three subjects in the photo.', '2006-04-26 22:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348466, 326156, 70, '<td valign="top">Love this! I''ve been really into this sort of shot lately. I almost wonder if I''d like the tips of the flower just a bit softer but very cool overall.</td>', 'Love this! I''ve been really into this sort of shot lately. I almost wonder if I''d like the tips of the flower just a bit softer but very cool overall.', '2006-04-26 22:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348475, 324331, 48228, '<td valign="top">"WOW".....This is amazing.....I love it.....</td>', '"WOW".....This is amazing.....I love it.....', '2006-04-26 22:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348481, 325906, 48228, '<td valign="top">Yes, I like this one.....</td>', 'Yes, I like this one.....', '2006-04-26 22:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348484, 326580, 48228, '<td valign="top">Another magical image.....</td>', 'Another magical image.....', '2006-04-26 22:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348486, 326142, 70, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea but suffered a bit in execution. The colors appear to be blue and red which aren''t complementary. There also doesn''t appear to be anything in focus.</td>', 'This is a good idea but suffered a bit in execution. The colors appear to be blue and red which aren''t complementary. There also doesn''t appear to be anything in focus.', '2006-04-26 22:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348491, 326128, 70, '<td valign="top">Neat idea. I think I Would have gone for the umbrella or the water drop but not both. Seems like it could use an overall color boost or perhaps a tiny bit more exposure? Nicely done, though.</td>', 'Neat idea. I think I Would have gone for the umbrella or the water drop but not both. Seems like it could use an overall color boost or perhaps a tiny bit more exposure? Nicely done, though.', '2006-04-26 22:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348496, 326345, 48228, '<td valign="top">Yes, another great image re this challenge.....</td>', 'Yes, another great image re this challenge.....', '2006-04-26 22:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348499, 326573, 70, '<td valign="top">Good idea. With something this simple, I think it''s really important that those two tips actually line up. Like it otherwise.</td>', 'Good idea. With something this simple, I think it''s really important that those two tips actually line up. Like it otherwise.', '2006-04-26 22:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348507, 325386, 48228, '<td valign="top">This actually works for me, and I think it is a really good image, that suits this challenge.....</td>', 'This actually works for me, and I think it is a really good image, that suits this challenge.....', '2006-04-26 22:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348509, 325196, 70, '<td valign="top">This looks like it''s been processed into something that''s not quite photorealistic but it''s fun to look at anyway.</td>', 'This looks like it''s been processed into something that''s not quite photorealistic but it''s fun to look at anyway.', '2006-04-26 22:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348538, 325381, 48228, '<td valign="top">So cute.....</td>', 'So cute.....', '2006-04-26 22:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348542, 326374, 15711, '<td valign="top">Spelling police: petals  LOL<br/> <br/>Lovely DOF - nice bright colors but the red kind of throws it off as blue/yellow are the complementary colors.</td>', 'Spelling police: petals  LOL Lovely DOF - nice bright colors but the red kind of throws it off as blue/yellow are the complementary colors.', '2006-04-26 22:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348546, 323929, 15711, '<td valign="top">Artsy! I like the swirling. Trying to figure out what it is.</td>', 'Artsy! I like the swirling. Trying to figure out what it is.', '2006-04-26 22:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348560, 324528, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. Until I looked it up, I didn''t know gold was purple''s compliment. The purple seems a bit magenta/red to my monitor Maybe an adjustement to put in a tad more blue might''ve made it more purple. Still, nicely done. 7</td>', 'Lovely image. Until I looked it up, I didn''t know gold was purple''s compliment. The purple seems a bit magenta/red to my monitor Maybe an adjustement to put in a tad more blue might''ve made it more purple. Still, nicely done. 7', '2006-04-26 22:53:29.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2348570, 326565, 15711, '<td valign="top">Skin seems a bit orange to me. The flowers don''t have quite the impact I''d like. Sort of ho hum - I''d like some vibrance. The focus and composition are well done.</td>', 'Skin seems a bit orange to me. The flowers don''t have quite the impact I''d like. Sort of ho hum - I''d like some vibrance. The focus and composition are well done.', '2006-04-26 22:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348579, 323773, 48228, '<td valign="top">SO cute.....</td>', 'SO cute.....', '2006-04-26 22:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348581, 326396, 15711, '<td valign="top">CUTE! Looks like an ad. I like it.</td>', 'CUTE! Looks like an ad. I like it.', '2006-04-26 23:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348595, 326495, 15711, '<td valign="top">This cracks me up. His shape mimics that of the stem of the pepper.  Hilarious expression. Looks like a grumpy old man. thanks for the smile.</td>', 'This cracks me up. His shape mimics that of the stem of the pepper.  Hilarious expression. Looks like a grumpy old man. thanks for the smile.', '2006-04-26 23:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348601, 324190, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I even like the perfectly centered focused tulip. Great DOF.  Quite lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful. I even like the perfectly centered focused tulip. Great DOF.  Quite lovely.', '2006-04-26 23:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348602, 326571, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great effort here. I don''t know how you did it. Good one.</td>', 'Great effort here. I don''t know how you did it. Good one.', '2006-04-26 23:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348604, 326110, 48228, '<td valign="top">Excellent,,,,,</td>', 'Excellent,,,,,', '2006-04-26 23:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348606, 323621, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great title. I like the diagonal sense of it too. Nice use of negative space. Thank GOD it isn''t a flower. ;~D Good luck.</td>', 'Great title. I like the diagonal sense of it too. Nice use of negative space. Thank GOD it isn''t a flower. ;~D Good luck.', '2006-04-26 23:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348610, 326470, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity and all that negative space.  NICE.</td>', 'Love the simplicity and all that negative space.  NICE.', '2006-04-26 23:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348627, 323636, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely. I like the deep tones of red creating the diagonal line. Nice use of negative space too.</td>', 'Lovely. I like the deep tones of red creating the diagonal line. Nice use of negative space too.', '2006-04-26 23:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348630, 326207, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the concept.  A variation in composition and sharper focus/more fore focus, make this better in my opinion.  Bigger as well.  Not sure on the frame, especially at this size.</td>', '4 - Like the concept.  A variation in composition and sharper focus/more fore focus, make this better in my opinion.  Bigger as well.  Not sure on the frame, especially at this size.', '2006-04-26 23:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348637, 325386, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the idea. I think I''d like him standing there not in an awkward pose.</td>', 'Love the idea. I think I''d like him standing there not in an awkward pose.', '2006-04-26 23:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348641, 325240, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Nice macro and use of light.  Main colors I''m seeing are yellow, green then red.  Color scheme not strong enough for this Challenge in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Nice macro and use of light.  Main colors I''m seeing are yellow, green then red.  Color scheme not strong enough for this Challenge in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 23:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348648, 326579, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice and simple.  More refined crop, especially bottom left, make this better in my opinion.  Difficult, but like to see the ''frayed edges'' of the tulips in more detail, but minor.</td>', '6 - Nice and simple.  More refined crop, especially bottom left, make this better in my opinion.  Difficult, but like to see the ''frayed edges'' of the tulips in more detail, but minor.', '2006-04-26 23:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348656, 326096, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL That''s too funny.</td>', 'ROFL That''s too funny.', '2006-04-26 23:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348657, 326251, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like it.  A little more balanced overall and, whilst difficult, more ''flow'' with less graininess, may also have given this a little extra in my opinion.  Possibly also more depth between the glasses (and clarity iin them) and the ''back'' but not sure.</td>', '7 - Like it.  A little more balanced overall and, whilst difficult, more ''flow'' with less graininess, may also have given this a little extra in my opinion.  Possibly also more depth between the glasses (and clarity iin them) and the ''back'' but not sure.', '2006-04-26 23:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348664, 324751, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - A much stronger crop, quality dependent, make this better in my opinion.  Silhouettes and ''balance'' works quite well, but the unusual patterns and colors in the sky especially, for this Challenge, likely put to better use with a tighter crop.</td>', '3 - A much stronger crop, quality dependent, make this better in my opinion.  Silhouettes and ''balance'' works quite well, but the unusual patterns and colors in the sky especially, for this Challenge, likely put to better use with a tighter crop.', '2006-04-26 23:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348665, 326498, 54256, '<td valign="top">Great setup - I just wish there wasn''t the heavy black line between the golf balls keeping the colors from working as well together as they could have.  Really nicely lit and framed.</td>', 'Great setup - I just wish there wasn''t the heavy black line between the golf balls keeping the colors from working as well together as they could have.  Really nicely lit and framed.', '2006-04-26 23:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348669, 326210, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Difficult with abstracts, but perhaps a more finely tuned crop and trying to eliminate the upper reflection in the ball(?)(as the lower part seems good and ''interesting'') make this even better in my opinion.  Tweaking of the orange/colors too, especially for this Challenge.</td>', '5 - Difficult with abstracts, but perhaps a more finely tuned crop and trying to eliminate the upper reflection in the ball(?)(as the lower part seems good and ''interesting'') make this even better in my opinion.  Tweaking of the orange/colors too, especially for this Challenge.', '2006-04-26 23:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348674, 324746, 45790, '<td valign="top">I''d shoot it with a more downward angle to get the fence and other distractions in the background out of the frame.</td>', 'I''d shoot it with a more downward angle to get the fence and other distractions in the background out of the frame.', '2006-04-26 23:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348676, 326508, 15711, '<td valign="top">Looks more like she''s eating it. ;&gt;~</td>', 'Looks more like she''s eating it. ;>~', '2006-04-26 23:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348677, 326591, 45790, '<td valign="top">It needs more DOF.</td>', 'It needs more DOF.', '2006-04-26 23:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348678, 324625, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - The reflections/glare detract too much in my opinion.  Fairly good detail in the fore parts though.  ''Works'', especially for stock photography style, etc.</td>', '4 - The reflections/glare detract too much in my opinion.  Fairly good detail in the fore parts though.  ''Works'', especially for stock photography style, etc.', '2006-04-26 23:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348681, 324280, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Less green and perhaps a tighter crop/zoom to take advantage of these two good colors together would have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Less green and perhaps a tighter crop/zoom to take advantage of these two good colors together would have made this better in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 23:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348687, 325131, 45790, '<td valign="top">Needs a reflector (or fill flash) to lighten up the bottom of the flower and the stem.</td>', 'Needs a reflector (or fill flash) to lighten up the bottom of the flower and the stem.', '2006-04-26 23:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348690, 323773, 45790, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space.</td>', 'Good use of negative space.', '2006-04-26 23:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348692, 326353, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Wow.  Bright.  Good detail in the water drops.  Perhaps a more finely tuned crop, trying to eliminate the OOF area(s) especially on the right may have given this a little extra in my opinion.  As well as reduced the green.  Difficult, but seems slightly ''too bright'' in some of the areas, though not sure.</td>', '6 - Wow.  Bright.  Good detail in the water drops.  Perhaps a more finely tuned crop, trying to eliminate the OOF area(s) especially on the right may have given this a little extra in my opinion.  As well as reduced the green.  Difficult, but seems slightly ''too bright'' in some of the areas, though not sure.', '2006-04-26 23:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348694, 325540, 54256, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and color.  In my opinion would be a littll stronger with more sharpness, especially in the airborn droplets.</td>', 'Nice capture and color.  In my opinion would be a littll stronger with more sharpness, especially in the airborn droplets.', '2006-04-26 23:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348695, 326143, 45790, '<td valign="top">Very clever! Lighting could be improved to eliminate glare and shadows on the eggs.</td>', 'Very clever! Lighting could be improved to eliminate glare and shadows on the eggs.', '2006-04-26 23:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348696, 324401, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Colors fairly well meet the Challenge.  Overall just not holding my interest enough.  Variation in background may have helped, not sure.</td>', '2 - Colors fairly well meet the Challenge.  Overall just not holding my interest enough.  Variation in background may have helped, not sure.', '2006-04-26 23:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348697, 324612, 45790, '<td valign="top">The prominent foreground is out of focus.</td>', 'The prominent foreground is out of focus.', '2006-04-26 23:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348700, 324736, 45790, '<td valign="top">Good natural shot.</td>', 'Good natural shot.', '2006-04-26 23:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348702, 323599, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Good potential.  Less face and more ''colors'' used, make this better in my opinion.  LIghting, whilst perhaps intentional, too bright or ''direct''/something, in my opinion.  An overall more balanced composition and refined crop, also have helped this.</td>', '2 - Good potential.  Less face and more ''colors'' used, make this better in my opinion.  LIghting, whilst perhaps intentional, too bright or ''direct''/something, in my opinion.  An overall more balanced composition and refined crop, also have helped this.', '2006-04-26 23:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348703, 326392, 45790, '<td valign="top">At last a floral shot without blown highlights and with great DOF. Superb!</td>', 'At last a floral shot without blown highlights and with great DOF. Superb!', '2006-04-26 23:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348705, 326272, 45790, '<td valign="top">Distracting OOF pansies at top. Better to have removed them or have a different crop.</td>', 'Distracting OOF pansies at top. Better to have removed them or have a different crop.', '2006-04-26 23:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348706, 326149, 45790, '<td valign="top">Nice appealing picture with vibrant complelmentary colors.</td>', 'Nice appealing picture with vibrant complelmentary colors.', '2006-04-26 23:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348710, 326143, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Not sure if you were going for an abstract shot here, but if so, a variation in the lighting, especially to gain more depth/drama and less glare, more fore focus and a slightly more refined crop, may have made this better in my opinion.  As is, looks a little ''snapshottish''.  Not sure on the concept, especially the eggs(?) (and the white they bring/no pun intended), but your call, obviously.</td>', '2 - Not sure if you were going for an abstract shot here, but if so, a variation in the lighting, especially to gain more depth/drama and less glare, more fore focus and a slightly more refined crop, may have made this better in my opinion.  As is, looks a little ''snapshottish''.  Not sure on the concept, especially the eggs(?) (and the white they bring/no pun intended), but your call, obviously.', '2006-04-26 23:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348714, 323814, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice.  Good use of ''forkeh''.  Difficult, but like to have seen more definition in the fore tulip, and less green, especially the straps/leaves.</td>', '5 - Nice.  Good use of ''forkeh''.  Difficult, but like to have seen more definition in the fore tulip, and less green, especially the straps/leaves.', '2006-04-26 23:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348715, 326579, 45790, '<td valign="top">Pleasing composition. Good use of background to get the complementary color instead of just relying on the stem. You should have clipped off the leaf in the bottom left to make this perfect.</td>', 'Pleasing composition. Good use of background to get the complementary color instead of just relying on the stem. You should have clipped off the leaf in the bottom left to make this perfect.', '2006-04-26 23:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348717, 325483, 39850, '<td valign="top">1 - Meets the Challenge mostly color-wise, but the concept, subjects and focus/quality, not holding my attention.</td>', '1 - Meets the Challenge mostly color-wise, but the concept, subjects and focus/quality, not holding my attention.', '2006-04-26 23:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348722, 325868, 45790, '<td valign="top">Effective use of near symmetry. Nice shot. My favorite.</td>', 'Effective use of near symmetry. Nice shot. My favorite.', '2006-04-26 23:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348731, 325082, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Not holding my attention enough, difficult to comment as this looks totally intentional.  Less blue at the bottom, more balanced compositionally, and better use of the color scheme, likely have helped this - but just my opinion.  Nudge rotate and cropping the bottom out entirely, make a different shot, but again - this (including colors/style/etc) looks intentional, so your call, obviously.</td>', '2 - Not holding my attention enough, difficult to comment as this looks totally intentional.  Less blue at the bottom, more balanced compositionally, and better use of the color scheme, likely have helped this - but just my opinion.  Nudge rotate and cropping the bottom out entirely, make a different shot, but again - this (including colors/style/etc) looks intentional, so your call, obviously.', '2006-04-26 23:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348739, 324736, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - More ''play'' with the colors and a nudge rotate up on the right, make this better in my opinion.  Looks like it has some grain/gamma issues as well.  Like to see this shot have been all about at least one set of complementary colors primarily.</td>', '2 - More ''play'' with the colors and a nudge rotate up on the right, make this better in my opinion.  Looks like it has some grain/gamma issues as well.  Like to see this shot have been all about at least one set of complementary colors primarily.', '2006-04-26 23:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348742, 326374, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Bordering on a bit of red but fairly minor.  Like the abstract and the perspective and detail in the peTal.  A more finely tuned crop, centering the focal point better somewhere within your composition make this better in my opinion.  Frame detracts, again - in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Bordering on a bit of red but fairly minor.  Like the abstract and the perspective and detail in the peTal.  A more finely tuned crop, centering the focal point better somewhere within your composition make this better in my opinion.  Frame detracts, again - in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348743, 326111, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice.  A little more fore focus and a more finely tuned crop, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Nice.  A little more fore focus and a more finely tuned crop, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 23:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348748, 326392, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice.  Like to have seen perhaps a slightly sharper angle, with the focus on at least one of the orange petals - for this Challenge, inmy opinion.  Color of the flower looks a little ''odd'', but could be pp/hue adjusting.  A more finely tuned crop, especially at the bottom as well.  Given the coloring this lily, perhaps a more subtle blue background may have complemented and ''enhanced'' it more, but your call, obviously.</td>', '7 - Nice.  Like to have seen perhaps a slightly sharper angle, with the focus on at least one of the orange petals - for this Challenge, inmy opinion.  Color of the flower looks a little ''odd'', but could be pp/hue adjusting.  A more finely tuned crop, especially at the bottom as well.  Given the coloring this lily, perhaps a more subtle blue background may have complemented and ''enhanced'' it more, but your call, obviously.', '2006-04-26 23:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348752, 325740, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like this.  Nice and simple.  Good use of colors.  Sharper/more definition in the ''bamboo'' and a variation in composition and possibly also framing, may have given this a little extra in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Like this.  Nice and simple.  Good use of colors.  Sharper/more definition in the ''bamboo'' and a variation in composition and possibly also framing, may have given this a little extra in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 23:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2348756, 324674, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like this.  Obviously a bit of hue adjusting pp, but it works in my opinion.  Like to have seen the yellow sky more vivid if possible.  No idea what the subject is.  Perhaps a variation in composition, especially this size, may have given this a little extra in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Like this.  Obviously a bit of hue adjusting pp, but it works in my opinion.  Like to have seen the yellow sky more vivid if possible.  No idea what the subject is.  Perhaps a variation in composition, especially this size, may have given this a little extra in my opinion.', '2006-04-26 23:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
