(2349074, 326496, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Difficult, variation in composition perhaps, or a much tighter crop, as well as more control of the ''yellow petals'', but likely difficult focal-wise with where the focal point currently is.  Minor details like the ''hair''/something in the center ''eradicated'' at time of shooting too, would help this in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Difficult, variation in composition perhaps, or a much tighter crop, as well as more control of the ''yellow petals'', but likely difficult focal-wise with where the focal point currently is.  Minor details like the ''hair''/something in the center ''eradicated'' at time of shooting too, would help this in my opinion.', '2006-04-27 00:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
