(2349168, 324633, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice shot.  Couple of schemes in here in my opinion (if not all), which still ''works'', just ''somehow'' like to have seen the colors/color scheme(s) more dominating.  Having said that, without the ''complementary colors'' this shot wouldn''t be as good in my opinion.  Nudge rotate up on the right possibly too, not sure.</td>', '5 - Nice shot.  Couple of schemes in here in my opinion (if not all), which still ''works'', just ''somehow'' like to have seen the colors/color scheme(s) more dominating.  Having said that, without the ''complementary colors'' this shot wouldn''t be as good in my opinion.  Nudge rotate up on the right possibly too, not sure.', '2006-04-27 00:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2349177, 326231, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very good.  Good stop motion.  Wish it were bigger, but I see it is 640 height, maybe gaining more width may have given this a little extra, not sure.  Difficult, but trying to reduce the glare/reflections, yet still being able to tweak the colors just a fraction, may have also helped this in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Very good.  Good stop motion.  Wish it were bigger, but I see it is 640 height, maybe gaining more width may have given this a little extra, not sure.  Difficult, but trying to reduce the glare/reflections, yet still being able to tweak the colors just a fraction, may have also helped this in my opinion.', '2006-04-27 00:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2349183, 326396, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Works well.  Good composition.  Perhaps even more symmetry and a little wider may have given this a little extra in my opinion, not sure.</td>', '7 - Works well.  Good composition.  Perhaps even more symmetry and a little wider may have given this a little extra in my opinion, not sure.', '2006-04-27 00:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2349233, 325401, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Nice macro/close up.  Bit too much of a stretch for me to try to get purple/yellow here though for this Challenge.</td>', '2 - Nice macro/close up.  Bit too much of a stretch for me to try to get purple/yellow here though for this Challenge.', '2006-04-27 00:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2349239, 324612, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Nice colors.  Difficult, but perhaps a more refined crop, quality dependent (especially to ''eliminate'' the green) and the focal point better placed within the composition ''somehow'', may have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Nice colors.  Difficult, but perhaps a more refined crop, quality dependent (especially to ''eliminate'' the green) and the focal point better placed within the composition ''somehow'', may have made this better in my opinion.', '2006-04-27 00:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2349261, 325604, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - I''m seeing hot pink and yellow here, with beginnings of red.  A hue adjustment (although realize that is likely what you''ve done, especially by the look of the yellow stigma), may have helped this.  Color/contrast of the flower just too harsh in my opinion.  Variation in composition/crop as well, not sure.  Too much detail in the flower is lost, again my opinion.  Realize this may all have been intentional though.</td>', '2 - I''m seeing hot pink and yellow here, with beginnings of red.  A hue adjustment (although realize that is likely what you''ve done, especially by the look of the yellow stigma), may have helped this.  Color/contrast of the flower just too harsh in my opinion.  Variation in composition/crop as well, not sure.  Too much detail in the flower is lost, again my opinion.  Realize this may all have been intentional though.', '2006-04-27 00:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2349273, 326414, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice.  More focus on the flower as well/flower further forward and perhaps not quite so tightly cropped around the flower, may have made this better in my opinion.  The ''spots'' top right detract, but fairly minor and yes I realize, ''basic editing''.</td>', '5 - Nice.  More focus on the flower as well/flower further forward and perhaps not quite so tightly cropped around the flower, may have made this better in my opinion.  The ''spots'' top right detract, but fairly minor and yes I realize, ''basic editing''.', '2006-04-27 00:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
