(2349314, 326410, 811, '<td valign="top">Hey, is this my picture??? ;)<br/> <br/>That looks like my sink (full of dishes)<br/>We have the exact same sippy cups<br/>The same bottles<br/>And a blue plate very similar to that.<br/> <br/>On a photographic note -- I think the interest (for most normal viewers that don''t have a sink full of sippy cups and bottles) could have been increased by getting closer and really letting the orange and green cup being the focus instead of just a single element of a lot of thngs.</td>', 'Hey, is this my picture??? ;) That looks like my sink (full of dishes)We have the exact same sippy cupsThe same bottlesAnd a blue plate very similar to that. On a photographic note -- I think the interest (for most normal viewers that don''t have a sink full of sippy cups and bottles) could have been increased by getting closer and really letting the orange and green cup being the focus instead of just a single element of a lot of thngs.', '2006-04-27 01:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
