(2350091, 325500, 52091, '<td valign="top">love how the paint just streams together</td>', 'love how the paint just streams together', '2006-04-27 09:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350092, 325166, 52091, '<td valign="top">good composition</td>', 'good composition', '2006-04-27 09:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350093, 326488, 52091, '<td valign="top">looks a little faded not to appealing but it meets the challenge</td>', 'looks a little faded not to appealing but it meets the challenge', '2006-04-27 09:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350097, 323938, 52091, '<td valign="top">too cute</td>', 'too cute', '2006-04-27 09:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350100, 323636, 54665, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better with more light on the flower.</td>', 'I would have liked this better with more light on the flower.', '2006-04-27 09:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350105, 325198, 54665, '<td valign="top">I little more saturation would have helped here. The colors look a little dull.</td>', 'I little more saturation would have helped here. The colors look a little dull.', '2006-04-27 09:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350110, 324881, 54665, '<td valign="top">Eye catching contrast. I like the sharp focus and edges.</td>', 'Eye catching contrast. I like the sharp focus and edges.', '2006-04-27 09:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350118, 326495, 54665, '<td valign="top">I love the texture in the skin.</td>', 'I love the texture in the skin.', '2006-04-27 10:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350120, 323938, 54665, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this a little brighter. It made me laugh though.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this a little brighter. It made me laugh though.', '2006-04-27 10:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350121, 324452, 53840, '<td valign="top">Nice but not very complementary!</td>', 'Nice but not very complementary!', '2006-04-27 10:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350125, 323459, 54665, '<td valign="top">The DOF made this feel unbalanced. Either it needed more chips or more queso, but probably less unfocused bowl rim.</td>', 'The DOF made this feel unbalanced. Either it needed more chips or more queso, but probably less unfocused bowl rim.', '2006-04-27 10:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350134, 325978, 54665, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but over sharped.</td>', 'I like the concept, but over sharped.', '2006-04-27 10:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350135, 326553, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think if the toothbrush on the right were green, it would be more effective, as blue/red aren''t complementary, but green/red or blue/yellow are. I do like the stop action and the perspective.</td>', 'I think if the toothbrush on the right were green, it would be more effective, as blue/red aren''t complementary, but green/red or blue/yellow are. I do like the stop action and the perspective.', '2006-04-27 10:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350138, 326046, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think I''d take the white and do a selective color adjustment and remove all of the black. IT kind of dulls the background color a smidge.  NOt overly interesting. Perhaps if you''d shot it from a different perspective?</td>', 'I think I''d take the white and do a selective color adjustment and remove all of the black. IT kind of dulls the background color a smidge.  NOt overly interesting. Perhaps if you''d shot it from a different perspective?', '2006-04-27 10:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350139, 323372, 15711, '<td valign="top">A touch washed out. Maybe an adjustment of curves would really enrich the overall tonality. Love the perspective.</td>', 'A touch washed out. Maybe an adjustment of curves would really enrich the overall tonality. Love the perspective.', '2006-04-27 10:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350143, 324708, 15711, '<td valign="top">In order for complementary colors - you need two: gold/purple, blue/yellow.  Hmmmm - I like the perspective and the silhouette, but I don''t see two colors here.</td>', 'In order for complementary colors - you need two: gold/purple, blue/yellow.  Hmmmm - I like the perspective and the silhouette, but I don''t see two colors here.', '2006-04-27 10:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350145, 325906, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DOF.  The clarity of the focused areas is spot on.  Really lovely. Not unusual, but well done for the bee/flower thing. 7</td>', 'I like the shallow DOF.  The clarity of the focused areas is spot on.  Really lovely. Not unusual, but well done for the bee/flower thing. 7', '2006-04-27 10:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350146, 326242, 15711, '<td valign="top">Red/green, blue/yellow are complementary. I''m seeing red/blue. Hmmmm</td>', 'Red/green, blue/yellow are complementary. I''m seeing red/blue. Hmmmm', '2006-04-27 10:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350149, 325240, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. I might work on the green background with selective color adjustment. It''s a tad olive, not true green.</td>', 'Nice macro. I might work on the green background with selective color adjustment. It''s a tad olive, not true green.', '2006-04-27 10:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350151, 323773, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - aren''t lady bugs cute? Seems a tad oversharp. I like the minimalist approach. Nice use of negative space.</td>', 'HEE HEE - aren''t lady bugs cute? Seems a tad oversharp. I like the minimalist approach. Nice use of negative space.', '2006-04-27 10:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350152, 324331, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cool. I like the vivid blue of the nude. Great contrast.</td>', 'Cool. I like the vivid blue of the nude. Great contrast.', '2006-04-27 10:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350159, 326395, 15711, '<td valign="top">We''ve seen the proverbial splash shot a zillion times, but this fits the challenge just fine.  My only complaint is the deadly "bullseye" centered subject. It would be so much more effective for me if the glass were way to one side with lots of negative space. Or maybe have the glass in one corner - it would really pull your eye to it. Nice stop action. Good use of the red/green.</td>', 'We''ve seen the proverbial splash shot a zillion times, but this fits the challenge just fine.  My only complaint is the deadly "bullseye" centered subject. It would be so much more effective for me if the glass were way to one side with lots of negative space. Or maybe have the glass in one corner - it would really pull your eye to it. Nice stop action. Good use of the red/green.', '2006-04-27 10:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350161, 326259, 54665, '<td valign="top">The focus needed to be on her. It appears to be on the wall.</td>', 'The focus needed to be on her. It appears to be on the wall.', '2006-04-27 10:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350163, 326106, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wonder if you played with the contrast if it would brighten it up overall. It has a dull sense to it.NoOt crazy about the border. I like the lighting and the use of the water droplets.</td>', 'I wonder if you played with the contrast if it would brighten it up overall. It has a dull sense to it.NoOt crazy about the border. I like the lighting and the use of the water droplets.', '2006-04-27 10:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350167, 326460, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen tons of macros and flower shots in this challenge but this one is really stunning.  The off centering of the flower''s middle is great.  The detail and perfect clarity works well. I''d love to see this HUGE - poster size. My one complaint is the leaf coming up and over the top. I think I''d like it better if it were Just the flower.  Still - a great effort.</td>', 'I''ve seen tons of macros and flower shots in this challenge but this one is really stunning.  The off centering of the flower''s middle is great.  The detail and perfect clarity works well. I''d love to see this HUGE - poster size. My one complaint is the leaf coming up and over the top. I think I''d like it better if it were Just the flower.  Still - a great effort.', '2006-04-27 10:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350178, 326375, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant. I wonder if you worked on the yellow with a selective adjustment and removed the cyan. It has a touch of green in it. The clarity and focus is good. I like the diagonal line the lily creates going across the shot. 7</td>', 'Simple and elegant. I wonder if you worked on the yellow with a selective adjustment and removed the cyan. It has a touch of green in it. The clarity and focus is good. I like the diagonal line the lily creates going across the shot. 7', '2006-04-27 10:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350179, 326218, 15711, '<td valign="top">nice.  I like the simplicity. Great perspective and use of negative space. I wonder if you adjusted saturation and contrast if it wouldn''t really have that POW factor. I love architectural studies. This would also be great in black and white, to create a totally different study. 7</td>', 'nice.  I like the simplicity. Great perspective and use of negative space. I wonder if you adjusted saturation and contrast if it wouldn''t really have that POW factor. I love architectural studies. This would also be great in black and white, to create a totally different study. 7', '2006-04-27 10:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350181, 326412, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the leading line.  Interesting perspective. I''d really up the saturation and contrast for the POW factor.  It''s there, just hiding a bit.</td>', 'I like the leading line.  Interesting perspective. I''d really up the saturation and contrast for the POW factor.  It''s there, just hiding a bit.', '2006-04-27 10:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350183, 326178, 15711, '<td valign="top">A tad overexposed. I''d like to see the flower darker. Maybe a selective adjustment of color would help. The focus is good. The line of the flowers going up the image is good.</td>', 'A tad overexposed. I''d like to see the flower darker. Maybe a selective adjustment of color would help. The focus is good. The line of the flowers going up the image is good.', '2006-04-27 10:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350184, 326148, 56167, '<td valign="top">pollen is a bit distacting but a very good idea</td>', 'pollen is a bit distacting but a very good idea', '2006-04-27 10:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350185, 326581, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this wouild have more effective POW if the colors were deepened with a curves adjustment or perhaps an adjustment of saturation and contrast.</td>', 'I think this wouild have more effective POW if the colors were deepened with a curves adjustment or perhaps an adjustment of saturation and contrast.', '2006-04-27 10:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350186, 325976, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space. I''d really work on the saturation and adjust the contrast for more pow.  The colors are rather flat. Also, I''d take the white and do selective color adjustment to remove the black. It''s an easy fix and might make the image appear more "clean."</td>', 'Nice use of negative space. I''d really work on the saturation and adjust the contrast for more pow.  The colors are rather flat. Also, I''d take the white and do selective color adjustment to remove the black. It''s an easy fix and might make the image appear more "clean."', '2006-04-27 10:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350188, 326498, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this but it has a flat sense. Maybe cause the balls are plastic? I love the negative space and the diagonal sense of the set up of the balls but overall, it leaves me a little blah.</td>', 'I like the idea of this but it has a flat sense. Maybe cause the balls are plastic? I love the negative space and the diagonal sense of the set up of the balls but overall, it leaves me a little blah.', '2006-04-27 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350189, 324674, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space. I think the colors are just not rich enough for this to work for complementary but I''d love it in black and white. I think it''d be an interesting study done that way.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space. I think the colors are just not rich enough for this to work for complementary but I''d love it in black and white. I think it''d be an interesting study done that way.', '2006-04-27 10:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350193, 324102, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this.  It''s a bit overexposed. Could be a fun study in black and white - the high contrast might work a bit better.</td>', 'I like the idea of this.  It''s a bit overexposed. Could be a fun study in black and white - the high contrast might work a bit better.', '2006-04-27 10:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350195, 326058, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple and I love it. Great DOF and use of negative space. I don''t know if this will go over well, but I like it. 7</td>', 'Simple and I love it. Great DOF and use of negative space. I don''t know if this will go over well, but I like it. 7', '2006-04-27 10:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350196, 326156, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great DOF. The bokeh effect is pretty.</td>', 'Great DOF. The bokeh effect is pretty.', '2006-04-27 10:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350200, 323599, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I think the crop seems a bit tight, but I like the idea of this alot.</td>', 'Interesting. I think the crop seems a bit tight, but I like the idea of this alot.', '2006-04-27 10:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350205, 324280, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is screaming for an adjustment of levels or curves. It would really deepen the tones. I like the perspective and DOF.</td>', 'This is screaming for an adjustment of levels or curves. It would really deepen the tones. I like the perspective and DOF.', '2006-04-27 10:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350208, 323886, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely perspective. That single lamp post really makes the shot. Two leading lines, which pulls your eye right to it. I like the velvety smooth water.</td>', 'Lovely perspective. That single lamp post really makes the shot. Two leading lines, which pulls your eye right to it. I like the velvety smooth water.', '2006-04-27 10:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350214, 326252, 15711, '<td valign="top">I understand the idea, but where''s the blue? There is a hint of it in the shadow under the ball, but I don''t see this as complementary. Hmmmm</td>', 'I understand the idea, but where''s the blue? There is a hint of it in the shadow under the ball, but I don''t see this as complementary. Hmmmm', '2006-04-27 10:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350215, 324237, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is  very pretty.  The paleness of the colors works. Great sense of diagonal line. The undulating movement of the stem is nice. Might be my favorite flower of the challenge.</td>', 'This is  very pretty.  The paleness of the colors works. Great sense of diagonal line. The undulating movement of the stem is nice. Might be my favorite flower of the challenge.', '2006-04-27 10:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350216, 324798, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the use of dark and light.  The diagonal and vertical lines created by the stems gives your eye something to do.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the use of dark and light.  The diagonal and vertical lines created by the stems gives your eye something to do.', '2006-04-27 10:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350220, 323886, 48115, '<td valign="top">bravo! edit: had rated this 9.. im changin it to a 10 :)</td>', 'bravo! edit: had rated this 9.. im changin it to a 10 :)', '2006-04-27 10:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
