(2351172, 325974, 36470, '<td valign="top">For such a balanced looking picture, I think I would have prefered a straight countertop.  The lighting is excellent. 7</td>', 'For such a balanced looking picture, I think I would have prefered a straight countertop.  The lighting is excellent. 7', '2006-04-27 17:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351174, 326076, 57229, '<td valign="top">Contrast is red/blue, which are not the complementary colours. Those are the two colours that are evenly weighted though - and what a contrast! Good title and theme, too.</td>', 'Contrast is red/blue, which are not the complementary colours. Those are the two colours that are evenly weighted though - and what a contrast! Good title and theme, too.', '2006-04-27 17:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
