(2351199, 323773, 33515, '<td valign="top">On of the best I have seen so far, the colors are very bright and the ladybug really stands out. I might have lower the perspective so the concrete or what ever she is walking on was not shown so much but that is just me. Best of luck, a 9 for now</td>', 'On of the best I have seen so far, the colors are very bright and the ladybug really stands out. I might have lower the perspective so the concrete or what ever she is walking on was not shown so much but that is just me. Best of luck, a 9 for now', '2006-04-27 17:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
