(2351291, 324881, 40371, '<td valign="top">Bet you are getting a little beaten up because the horizon is askew.  I like it when photogs actually go out and find something complimentary instead of doing a studio shot...extra points for that.</td>', 'Bet you are getting a little beaten up because the horizon is askew.  I like it when photogs actually go out and find something complimentary instead of doing a studio shot...extra points for that.', '2006-04-27 17:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
