(2351298, 325973, 811, '<td valign="top">Just a personal note, I really don''t like this as a frame.  It would make a nice greeting card, matted print or something, but it looks a little odd to me.  For the purpose of the challenge, I think you would have been better served to use all that black frame to let us see what appears to be an awesome shot.  (and no, it does not effect teh score I give, just wanted to give an opinion)<br/> <br/>Teh shot is very nice.  I like the high/tight crop you have used, and the colors are very nice as well.</td>', 'Just a personal note, I really don''t like this as a frame.  It would make a nice greeting card, matted print or something, but it looks a little odd to me.  For the purpose of the challenge, I think you would have been better served to use all that black frame to let us see what appears to be an awesome shot.  (and no, it does not effect teh score I give, just wanted to give an opinion) Teh shot is very nice.  I like the high/tight crop you have used, and the colors are very nice as well.', '2006-04-27 17:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
