(2351360, 323599, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so striking.  I love the soft tones in the face. . .and those eyes are aMAZING!   My only small complaint is that looks like oversharpening or something in her hair that almost makes it look over-exposed.  But its beautiful and appealing, and my favorite so far.  8</td>', 'This is so striking.  I love the soft tones in the face. . .and those eyes are aMAZING!   My only small complaint is that looks like oversharpening or something in her hair that almost makes it look over-exposed.  But its beautiful and appealing, and my favorite so far.  8', '2006-04-27 18:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
