(2351534, 325240, 42125, '<td valign="top">IMO the top should have been cut off but other than that it is quite nice. Really good focus.</td>', 'IMO the top should have been cut off but other than that it is quite nice. Really good focus.', '2006-04-27 19:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
