(2351547, 326123, 42125, '<td valign="top">But what about the green one?</td>', 'But what about the green one?', '2006-04-27 19:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351552, 324742, 42125, '<td valign="top">Colours are fine, focus on flower fine, IMO the cropping more from the top should have fitted better.</td>', 'Colours are fine, focus on flower fine, IMO the cropping more from the top should have fitted better.', '2006-04-27 19:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351556, 323636, 42125, '<td valign="top">Wonderful flower. Nice lighting, a bit to much white background imo.</td>', 'Wonderful flower. Nice lighting, a bit to much white background imo.', '2006-04-27 19:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351564, 326150, 42125, '<td valign="top">The red one is not well focused. That is porbably because the camera uses the green light in focusing and the red one is not focused on the same place.<br/>(I am not 100% sure in these matters :-) just something I heard somewhere)</td>', 'The red one is not well focused. That is porbably because the camera uses the green light in focusing and the red one is not focused on the same place.(I am not 100% sure in these matters :-) just something I heard somewhere)', '2006-04-27 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351567, 325541, 42125, '<td valign="top">Nice curves the viewer follows. Colours are wonderful and everything is well focused.</td>', 'Nice curves the viewer follows. Colours are wonderful and everything is well focused.', '2006-04-27 19:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351570, 326580, 42125, '<td valign="top">You should have glued the paper on the wall. A small distracting shadow from it ruins a bit.<br/>Overall good.</td>', 'You should have glued the paper on the wall. A small distracting shadow from it ruins a bit.Overall good.', '2006-04-27 19:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351579, 326481, 42125, '<td valign="top">Lovely flower, crisp and good focus. Lighting looks natural and is good.</td>', 'Lovely flower, crisp and good focus. Lighting looks natural and is good.', '2006-04-27 20:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351582, 325512, 42125, '<td valign="top">They are all fallen :-)<br/>Good placement of subject but you could cut a bit more of the blackness imo.</td>', 'They are all fallen :-)Good placement of subject but you could cut a bit more of the blackness imo.', '2006-04-27 20:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351584, 326251, 42125, '<td valign="top">Makes me dizzy Lizzy!<br/>Nice idea, good colours, good focus and lighting ok.</td>', 'Makes me dizzy Lizzy!Nice idea, good colours, good focus and lighting ok.', '2006-04-27 20:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351589, 324957, 42125, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.<br/>Tighter crop on the dish imo would have been better. Turn the milk container around or just skip it.<br/>Focus fine on subject but there is a bit too much light on one of the MMs in the spoon.</td>', 'Nice idea.Tighter crop on the dish imo would have been better. Turn the milk container around or just skip it.Focus fine on subject but there is a bit too much light on one of the MMs in the spoon.', '2006-04-27 20:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351595, 325500, 42125, '<td valign="top">I would have tried to have a bit better focus on the pencil. In this way, the main subject is distracting.<br/>Nice idea and colours are good.<br/>The corners of the photo seem a bit darker (vignetting) and should maybe have cut a bit more or but a bit more light in the picture.</td>', 'I would have tried to have a bit better focus on the pencil. In this way, the main subject is distracting.Nice idea and colours are good.The corners of the photo seem a bit darker (vignetting) and should maybe have cut a bit more or but a bit more light in the picture.', '2006-04-27 20:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351598, 326470, 42125, '<td valign="top">This is as white as it can get with complimentary colours.<br/>Nice idea, good colours, focus ok but a bit to much minimalism for my taste.</td>', 'This is as white as it can get with complimentary colours.Nice idea, good colours, focus ok but a bit to much minimalism for my taste.', '2006-04-27 20:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351600, 326329, 42125, '<td valign="top">Nice butterflies amd colours but imo I want to see more then just a picture of artwork.</td>', 'Nice butterflies amd colours but imo I want to see more then just a picture of artwork.', '2006-04-27 20:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351602, 326329, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Left a comment before but seems it didn''t ''stick''.  Like the concept with this, and whilst the ''red'' is bordering on brown, still ''pass'' to me.  I think if a slight variation in composition and cropping, especially to allow the ''shadow play'' to be shown more within the frame, make this better in my opinion.  It''s the shadow play that really gives this a little extra, in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Left a comment before but seems it didn''t ''stick''.  Like the concept with this, and whilst the ''red'' is bordering on brown, still ''pass'' to me.  I think if a slight variation in composition and cropping, especially to allow the ''shadow play'' to be shown more within the frame, make this better in my opinion.  It''s the shadow play that really gives this a little extra, in my opinion.', '2006-04-27 20:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351605, 323621, 42125, '<td valign="top">What a great picture this is. Read ship in the green ocean :-).<br/>Good "natural" lighting, good focus, perfect capture and the cropping is perfect too.</td>', 'What a great picture this is. Read ship in the green ocean :-).Good "natural" lighting, good focus, perfect capture and the cropping is perfect too.', '2006-04-27 20:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351608, 323604, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Nice shot and angle of the tulips.  Perhaps an even more ''front on'' angle, using the yellow ones ''more'', and diminishing the blue (and green) as much as possible for this Challenge, make this better in my opinion.  Nice shot as is, but for the Challenge there''s too much blue - in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Nice shot and angle of the tulips.  Perhaps an even more ''front on'' angle, using the yellow ones ''more'', and diminishing the blue (and green) as much as possible for this Challenge, make this better in my opinion.  Nice shot as is, but for the Challenge there''s too much blue - in my opinion.', '2006-04-27 20:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351615, 325511, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - I''m seeing predominantly red, yellow then green here.  Perhaps a different angle or crop, using the red/green or, if the tulip(?) is ''purple'' further down, then ''showing'' that, and the yellow, may have made this a bit stronger for this Challenge in my opinion.</td>', '3 - I''m seeing predominantly red, yellow then green here.  Perhaps a different angle or crop, using the red/green or, if the tulip(?) is ''purple'' further down, then ''showing'' that, and the yellow, may have made this a bit stronger for this Challenge in my opinion.', '2006-04-27 20:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351622, 326427, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Nice capture and good potential.  For me (and indeed your frame color shows it as well), this is more pink and green, rather than red.  There are traces of yellow in the shot, etc etc.. so it''s a ''pass'', just, from me, but not as strong as I''d like to have seen for this Challenge.  Perhaps tweaking the colors, including hue, may have given this extra, who knows.  Difficult, but like to have seen a little more texture and detail in the moth, but opportunity capture, etc.  Also, compositionally, perhaps a little more space either side (depending what you had of course), else perhaps even more ''angled'' and ''off-set'', if that makes sense, may have given this a little more overall balance and made it a stronger image, in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Nice capture and good potential.  For me (and indeed your frame color shows it as well), this is more pink and green, rather than red.  There are traces of yellow in the shot, etc etc.. so it''s a ''pass'', just, from me, but not as strong as I''d like to have seen for this Challenge.  Perhaps tweaking the colors, including hue, may have given this extra, who knows.  Difficult, but like to have seen a little more texture and detail in the moth, but opportunity capture, etc.  Also, compositionally, perhaps a little more space either side (depending what you had of course), else perhaps even more ''angled'' and ''off-set'', if that makes sense, may have given this a little more overall balance and made it a stronger image, in my opinion.', '2006-04-27 20:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351625, 324033, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Whilst bordering on orange to me, I can see traces of red.  LIke the perspective, just wish the reds/oranges had more detail in them and not ''blown'' so much in areas, same with the leaves top/top right.</td>', '4 - Whilst bordering on orange to me, I can see traces of red.  LIke the perspective, just wish the reds/oranges had more detail in them and not ''blown'' so much in areas, same with the leaves top/top right.', '2006-04-27 20:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351626, 326226, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Like to have seen the blue more, even if tweaked pp.  Perhaps a tighter crop would have helped, who knows.  Frame detracts from the simplicity of the image in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Like to have seen the blue more, even if tweaked pp.  Perhaps a tighter crop would have helped, who knows.  Frame detracts from the simplicity of the image in my opinion.', '2006-04-27 20:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351628, 323440, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Don''t mind the close crop, but the quality needs to be there.  Not sure what you''ve done pp with this but it appears totally flat and void of detail.  Color-wise, bordering on red, but not strongly enough in my opinion, although I realise that this flower may have been more red in person, but you haven''t captured that, especially with the processing.  For this Challenge, perhaps tweaking in pp may have helped you, but you''d still be left with the quality issues.</td>', '2 - Don''t mind the close crop, but the quality needs to be there.  Not sure what you''ve done pp with this but it appears totally flat and void of detail.  Color-wise, bordering on red, but not strongly enough in my opinion, although I realise that this flower may have been more red in person, but you haven''t captured that, especially with the processing.  For this Challenge, perhaps tweaking in pp may have helped you, but you''d still be left with the quality issues.', '2006-04-27 20:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351630, 324509, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Colors seem to have come through ''true''.  Focus seems off and/or a little ''blurry''.  Traces of grain/something as well, which could be due to resizing, who knows.  Like the crop.  Just like to have seen the colors tweaked more and (although looks difficult with the ''white'' of the cut strawberry), as mentioned, more detail and texture.  Again, quality dependent, this at 640 would have had more impact as well.</td>', '4 - Colors seem to have come through ''true''.  Focus seems off and/or a little ''blurry''.  Traces of grain/something as well, which could be due to resizing, who knows.  Like the crop.  Just like to have seen the colors tweaked more and (although looks difficult with the ''white'' of the cut strawberry), as mentioned, more detail and texture.  Again, quality dependent, this at 640 would have had more impact as well.', '2006-04-27 20:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351632, 326570, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - The green in the ceramics is nice.  Your call on the choice of framing/crop, obviously, but I wonder if a little more width, and more jug/pouring incorporated may have made this even better.  A slight nudge rotate up on the left too, just to get it ''level''.</td>', '5 - The green in the ceramics is nice.  Your call on the choice of framing/crop, obviously, but I wonder if a little more width, and more jug/pouring incorporated may have made this even better.  A slight nudge rotate up on the left too, just to get it ''level''.', '2006-04-27 20:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351637, 325199, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like the strong colors.  Concept slightly unusual, like to have seen more detail in the water(?) ''rising'', quality dependent, perhaps a tighter crop may have helped this, or perhaps a different angle, if possible, who knows.  Seems a little grain in the yellows as well, but difficult.  Variation in composition may have also given this a bit more of an edge, in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Like the strong colors.  Concept slightly unusual, like to have seen more detail in the water(?) ''rising'', quality dependent, perhaps a tighter crop may have helped this, or perhaps a different angle, if possible, who knows.  Seems a little grain in the yellows as well, but difficult.  Variation in composition may have also given this a bit more of an edge, in my opinion.', '2006-04-27 20:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351644, 325235, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like the concept.  Like to have seen the colors richer, not <i>quite</i> so high key (but your call, obviously) and minor aspects, especially of the ''fore apple'' (looks like some ''fluff'', plus the surface/skin etc) and possibly tweaking of colors - the red dish at the rear clashes slightly with the red of the fore apples, if that makes sense - in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Like the concept.  Like to have seen the colors richer, not quite so high key (but your call, obviously) and minor aspects, especially of the ''fore apple'' (looks like some ''fluff'', plus the surface/skin etc) and possibly tweaking of colors - the red dish at the rear clashes slightly with the red of the fore apples, if that makes sense - in my opinion.', '2006-04-27 20:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351653, 324331, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Colors work quite well together here, but not sure they together are the dominant aspect of this shot.  The blue toning works well, but the picture used, is possibly controversial re the ''literal artwork'' rule, etc.   Unusual refraction in the glass.  Overall, not my taste/style.</td>', '4 - Colors work quite well together here, but not sure they together are the dominant aspect of this shot.  The blue toning works well, but the picture used, is possibly controversial re the ''literal artwork'' rule, etc.   Unusual refraction in the glass.  Overall, not my taste/style.', '2006-04-27 20:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351655, 325366, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice.  Like the simplicity and the concept.  ''If only'' a little sharper focus on the flowers, but difficult.  Colors very nice.  Composition works as is, in my opinion, but might also lend itself to equally good, (if not better, who knows), variations, to enhance it even more.</td>', '6 - Nice.  Like the simplicity and the concept.  ''If only'' a little sharper focus on the flowers, but difficult.  Colors very nice.  Composition works as is, in my opinion, but might also lend itself to equally good, (if not better, who knows), variations, to enhance it even more.', '2006-04-27 20:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351671, 324609, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Ok.  Colors seem quite good, the stop motion, whilst showing an unusual ''flow'', is not as sharp as it would need to be for a shot like this to work best, in my opinion.  However, will be back PC to see how you got this fish out of the water.</td>', '2 - Ok.  Colors seem quite good, the stop motion, whilst showing an unusual ''flow'', is not as sharp as it would need to be for a shot like this to work best, in my opinion.  However, will be back PC to see how you got this fish out of the water.', '2006-04-27 20:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351678, 325500, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Don''t mind the concept.  The white base/lighting/something isn''t enhancing the image nor colors as well as perhaps a different color (difficult) may have.  Might just be the lighting though, not sure.  Like to have seen perhaps a little sharper angle/perspective, with less brush handle and label detail on the bottles, and more on the colors/paint, if that makes sense.</td>', '5 - Don''t mind the concept.  The white base/lighting/something isn''t enhancing the image nor colors as well as perhaps a different color (difficult) may have.  Might just be the lighting though, not sure.  Like to have seen perhaps a little sharper angle/perspective, with less brush handle and label detail on the bottles, and more on the colors/paint, if that makes sense.', '2006-04-27 20:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351681, 325882, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Bit of a stretch.  Perhaps a tweaking of the colors pp to get the bear a little more orange may have made this a stronger image.  Seems a little blurry as well, so aiming for a more ''steady hand'' may have helped you.  Larger too - again, quality dependent.  Still going to be a shot of a bear with a Bronco''s hat on - so won''t necessarily appeal to most nor hold their attention very strongly, unless it has certain ''dynamics'' in it, which perhaps need a little more work here, in my opinion.</td>', '2 - Bit of a stretch.  Perhaps a tweaking of the colors pp to get the bear a little more orange may have made this a stronger image.  Seems a little blurry as well, so aiming for a more ''steady hand'' may have helped you.  Larger too - again, quality dependent.  Still going to be a shot of a bear with a Bronco''s hat on - so won''t necessarily appeal to most nor hold their attention very strongly, unless it has certain ''dynamics'' in it, which perhaps need a little more work here, in my opinion.', '2006-04-27 21:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351685, 325745, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Don''t mind the oddness nor abstractness and the coloring is good as is the clarity, seemingly.  A variation in composition and cropping, possibly also angle, may have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Don''t mind the oddness nor abstractness and the coloring is good as is the clarity, seemingly.  A variation in composition and cropping, possibly also angle, may have made this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-27 21:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351690, 324462, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice.  Wish it were bigger (640 height).  Given the focus is sharper on the petals, perhaps a variation in the composition/crop would have made this even better in my opinion.  Colors are nice, but would like to have seen a fraction less green, but difficult.  Like the ''hairs'' on the petals - again, if to ''somehow'' have incorporated them, and ''held onto'' the colors, may have made this a stronger image for this Challenge in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.</td>', '5 - Nice.  Wish it were bigger (640 height).  Given the focus is sharper on the petals, perhaps a variation in the composition/crop would have made this even better in my opinion.  Colors are nice, but would like to have seen a fraction less green, but difficult.  Like the ''hairs'' on the petals - again, if to ''somehow'' have incorporated them, and ''held onto'' the colors, may have made this a stronger image for this Challenge in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.', '2006-04-27 21:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351701, 325370, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good.  Although the framing works quite well in my opinion, wonder whether this might have packed more punch with more ''red''/closer zoom, using the extra pixels, who knows.  A little sharper on eyes, may have also given this a little extra.  Perhaps the colors a little more vivid too, but difficult, especially with likely resulting contrast/etc issues.</td>', '6 - Good.  Although the framing works quite well in my opinion, wonder whether this might have packed more punch with more ''red''/closer zoom, using the extra pixels, who knows.  A little sharper on eyes, may have also given this a little extra.  Perhaps the colors a little more vivid too, but difficult, especially with likely resulting contrast/etc issues.', '2006-04-27 21:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351708, 326491, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Think I can see what you were going for but don''t think you have achieved the full potential.  Perhaps a variation in lighting and focus may have helped, not sure.  Also, given what appear to be green eyes (and indeed the brown hair), perhaps going for the red/green scheme may have been more.. ''complementary''.  Even a close up of the skin may have worked well here, but framed as is, with the lighting, clothing, etc.. not working as well as it could be, in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Think I can see what you were going for but don''t think you have achieved the full potential.  Perhaps a variation in lighting and focus may have helped, not sure.  Also, given what appear to be green eyes (and indeed the brown hair), perhaps going for the red/green scheme may have been more.. ''complementary''.  Even a close up of the skin may have worked well here, but framed as is, with the lighting, clothing, etc.. not working as well as it could be, in my opinion.', '2006-04-27 21:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351710, 323701, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Very nice and unusual effects here, hoping all ''bokeh'' and in camera and not something pp.  Main thing though, in my opinion, is this is predominantly blue, green, then ''other'' colors.  Like to have seen (quality dependent) a much tighter crop, eliminating the green and ''showcasing'' that flower with the yellow center - which may also have meant some hue adjustment in pp for this Challenge to get blue/orange or purple/yellow, who knows.</td>', '3 - Very nice and unusual effects here, hoping all ''bokeh'' and in camera and not something pp.  Main thing though, in my opinion, is this is predominantly blue, green, then ''other'' colors.  Like to have seen (quality dependent) a much tighter crop, eliminating the green and ''showcasing'' that flower with the yellow center - which may also have meant some hue adjustment in pp for this Challenge to get blue/orange or purple/yellow, who knows.', '2006-04-27 21:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351713, 326499, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - ''Ok''.  Meets the Challenge quite well but colors are not dominant enough in my opinion and the concept isn''t holding my attention.  Different, but... perhaps a variation in lighting or something, not sure.</td>', '3 - ''Ok''.  Meets the Challenge quite well but colors are not dominant enough in my opinion and the concept isn''t holding my attention.  Different, but... perhaps a variation in lighting or something, not sure.', '2006-04-27 21:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
