(2351871, 326056, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Up from 6.  Like this, but guessing it''s tweaked in pp, which for the Challenge, is ''fine'' in my opinion... just like to have seen the natural color of the little hyacinth - apologies in advance if you''ve not adjusted the color.  A variation in composition may have also given this a little extra, not sure, as does work well as is.  Nice macro, but ''if only'' a little more detail in the flowers, but difficult.</td>', '7 - Up from 6.  Like this, but guessing it''s tweaked in pp, which for the Challenge, is ''fine'' in my opinion... just like to have seen the natural color of the little hyacinth - apologies in advance if you''ve not adjusted the color.  A variation in composition may have also given this a little extra, not sure, as does work well as is.  Nice macro, but ''if only'' a little more detail in the flowers, but difficult.', '2006-04-27 22:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351876, 326351, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like this, including the title.  Like the simplicity and the vivid colors.  ''If only'' the focal point either on one of the barbs, else just a little ''wider''.. bringing in a little more detail and color, make this even better in my opinion.  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - Like this, including the title.  Like the simplicity and the vivid colors.  ''If only'' the focal point either on one of the barbs, else just a little ''wider''.. bringing in a little more detail and color, make this even better in my opinion.  Up to 7 from 6.', '2006-04-27 22:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351878, 323369, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Color is good, but the blown areas detract, as does the ''a little too close'' focal issues and the shadows, in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Color is good, but the blown areas detract, as does the ''a little too close'' focal issues and the shadows, in my opinion.', '2006-04-27 22:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351880, 326498, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Simple and clean, color is good, well done on the lighting to just about eliminate glare/reflection - just overall doesn''t ''hold my attention''.</td>', '5 - Simple and clean, color is good, well done on the lighting to just about eliminate glare/reflection - just overall doesn''t ''hold my attention''.', '2006-04-27 22:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351883, 324528, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like the purple and yellow, but would like to have seen less stem and leaf/green and more detail in the tulip/the tulip and color of it, dominating and complementing the yellow more.</td>', '5 - Like the purple and yellow, but would like to have seen less stem and leaf/green and more detail in the tulip/the tulip and color of it, dominating and complementing the yellow more.', '2006-04-27 22:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351884, 325880, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Clean.  Works well as a ''stock'' type of shot in my opinion - just not holding my attention otherwise.</td>', '5 - Clean.  Works well as a ''stock'' type of shot in my opinion - just not holding my attention otherwise.', '2006-04-27 22:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351886, 326078, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like the colors.  Don''t mind the abstractness.  Less grain in the purple and more detail in the yellow, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Like the colors.  Don''t mind the abstractness.  Less grain in the purple and more detail in the yellow, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-04-27 22:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351891, 326439, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Colors seem ok.  Base detracts slightly in my opinion.  Overall, a little too close to previous Challenges that to enter a shot like this is taking a certain risk in my opinion, has to be ''extra good'', if that makes sense.  This with a variation as mentioned in the base and overall a lot cleaner.. likely help this in my opinion.  Just doesn''t hold my attention/interest enough.</td>', '5 - Colors seem ok.  Base detracts slightly in my opinion.  Overall, a little too close to previous Challenges that to enter a shot like this is taking a certain risk in my opinion, has to be ''extra good'', if that makes sense.  This with a variation as mentioned in the base and overall a lot cleaner.. likely help this in my opinion.  Just doesn''t hold my attention/interest enough.', '2006-04-27 22:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351894, 326150, 53164, '<td valign="top">it all seems soft. (not just chewy like soft). lol. would have liked it a bit sharper on the red guy</td>', 'it all seems soft. (not just chewy like soft). lol. would have liked it a bit sharper on the red guy', '2006-04-27 22:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351897, 323440, 53164, '<td valign="top">pretty bright.  oof as well. unsure it is actually complimentary either.</td>', 'pretty bright.  oof as well. unsure it is actually complimentary either.', '2006-04-27 22:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351900, 324969, 53164, '<td valign="top">it doesnt quite seem that the water is actually green (at least in the picture).</td>', 'it doesnt quite seem that the water is actually green (at least in the picture).', '2006-04-27 22:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351901, 325331, 42135, '<td valign="top">Title is great LOL</td>', 'Title is great LOL', '2006-04-27 22:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351903, 326495, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Up from 5.  Like this, but the ''green'' of the chameleon is clashing a little with the green of the stem, and draws attention to the ''quality'' of the skin of the stem as well, if that makes sense.  Not sure what to suggest, perhaps ''putting it'' on the ''red'', who knows.  Perhaps even the chameleon on its own, as has good color in it.  Just needs a little ''extra'', somewhere, especially for this Challenge, in my opinion. <i>edit:typo</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-03 18:31:58.</i></td>', '6 - Up from 5.  Like this, but the ''green'' of the chameleon is clashing a little with the green of the stem, and draws attention to the ''quality'' of the skin of the stem as well, if that makes sense.  Not sure what to suggest, perhaps ''putting it'' on the ''red'', who knows.  Perhaps even the chameleon on its own, as has good color in it.  Just needs a little ''extra'', somewhere, especially for this Challenge, in my opinion. edit:typo', '2006-04-27 22:25:26.000000', '2006-05-03 19:31:58.000000', 1),
(2351904, 326410, 53164, '<td valign="top">bit of a clutter.</td>', 'bit of a clutter.', '2006-04-27 22:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351905, 323995, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Your title draws attention away from the orange - which, if were tweaked and stronger, make this better in my opinion.  Like the blue captured, but like to have seen the overall ''scheme'' stronger.</td>', '4 - Your title draws attention away from the orange - which, if were tweaked and stronger, make this better in my opinion.  Like the blue captured, but like to have seen the overall ''scheme'' stronger.', '2006-04-27 22:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351908, 325880, 53164, '<td valign="top">i love tis shot. the reflection is excquisite. how many times did you have to polish that mirror. lol</td>', 'i love tis shot. the reflection is excquisite. how many times did you have to polish that mirror. lol', '2006-04-27 22:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351909, 326048, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the concept, but like to see a little more definition in the dunes, and also the blue a little stronger.</td>', '4 - Like the concept, but like to see a little more definition in the dunes, and also the blue a little stronger.', '2006-04-27 22:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351912, 324088, 53164, '<td valign="top">i am sure you will know after this shot that too small is not a good thing.</td>', 'i am sure you will know after this shot that too small is not a good thing.', '2006-04-27 22:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351913, 324638, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - A more refined crop and variation in angle/perspective, may have made this better in my opinion.  Like to have seen the colors tweaked.  Whilst fairly creative, not holding my attention strongly enough.  But depends which ''audience'' you''re catering to/aiming for, obviously.</td>', '4 - A more refined crop and variation in angle/perspective, may have made this better in my opinion.  Like to have seen the colors tweaked.  Whilst fairly creative, not holding my attention strongly enough.  But depends which ''audience'' you''re catering to/aiming for, obviously.', '2006-04-27 22:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351915, 326096, 53164, '<td valign="top">lol.  probably should have.</td>', 'lol.  probably should have.', '2006-04-27 22:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351917, 325396, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Don''t mind the close crop, a little more depth/sharper perspective and perhaps a nudge rotate up on the right, make this better in my opinion.  I''m seeing more orange than red here as well.</td>', '4 - Don''t mind the close crop, a little more depth/sharper perspective and perhaps a nudge rotate up on the right, make this better in my opinion.  I''m seeing more orange than red here as well.', '2006-04-27 22:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351920, 326381, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like to have seen the orange stronger for the Challenge, so perhaps tweaking in pp and a tighter crop may have made this better, in my opinion.  Also looks a little ''tilted'', but could just be the perspective.</td>', '4 - Like to have seen the orange stronger for the Challenge, so perhaps tweaking in pp and a tighter crop may have made this better, in my opinion.  Also looks a little ''tilted'', but could just be the perspective.', '2006-04-27 22:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351923, 324236, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like this.  Like to have seen the colors tweaked - almost two ''schemes'' here in my opinion.  Like to have seen one or the other ''stronger''.</td>', '5 - Like this.  Like to have seen the colors tweaked - almost two ''schemes'' here in my opinion.  Like to have seen one or the other ''stronger''.', '2006-04-27 22:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351924, 326495, 42135, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo!</td>', 'Awesome photo!', '2006-04-27 22:32:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2351925, 325868, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Detail in the fabrics and the color choice is nice.  Otherwise just not holding my attention enough.</td>', '4 - Detail in the fabrics and the color choice is nice.  Otherwise just not holding my attention enough.', '2006-04-27 22:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351928, 326106, 53164, '<td valign="top">very nice colors.  i think that giving the plate a bit of texture worked great. it would have been somewhat drab ifn you didnt, but i guess you already knew that.  um.... well done.</td>', 'very nice colors.  i think that giving the plate a bit of texture worked great. it would have been somewhat drab ifn you didnt, but i guess you already knew that.  um.... well done.', '2006-04-27 22:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351930, 325540, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Like the yellow, but the skin looks a bit ''odd'', but could just be distorted under the water.  Colors go quite well together.  Otherwise, just not holding my attention enough.  Perhaps a variation in angle, not sure.  Also, looks like some gamma issues in the dark areas up the top, or could be some type of reflection, who knows.</td>', '4 - Like the yellow, but the skin looks a bit ''odd'', but could just be distorted under the water.  Colors go quite well together.  Otherwise, just not holding my attention enough.  Perhaps a variation in angle, not sure.  Also, looks like some gamma issues in the dark areas up the top, or could be some type of reflection, who knows.', '2006-04-27 22:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351932, 326491, 53164, '<td valign="top">omg!!  that must have been a bit of work getting that right. well done</td>', 'omg!!  that must have been a bit of work getting that right. well done', '2006-04-27 22:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351936, 323610, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Don''t mind the concept, but think more clarity/better focus make this better in my opinion.  Colors are good.  Bigger also, quality dependent, may have also helped.</td>', '3 - Don''t mind the concept, but think more clarity/better focus make this better in my opinion.  Colors are good.  Bigger also, quality dependent, may have also helped.', '2006-04-27 22:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351937, 325366, 53164, '<td valign="top">would have been better ifn your break away person was in focus. at least in my opinion.</td>', 'would have been better ifn your break away person was in focus. at least in my opinion.', '2006-04-27 22:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351938, 325512, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Colors on the building are quite nice, otherwise not holding my attention.  Perhaps a tighter crop, not sure.</td>', '3 - Colors on the building are quite nice, otherwise not holding my attention.  Perhaps a tighter crop, not sure.', '2006-04-27 22:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351939, 326143, 53164, '<td valign="top">great idea. well photographed as well.</td>', 'great idea. well photographed as well.', '2006-04-27 22:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351941, 324016, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Colors look quite nice, but perhaps a tweaking, especially of the yellow - ''brighter'' make this better in my opinion.  Overall, not sure on the crop, looks like the top half is missing.  Some grain/noise issues on the outer areas of frame.  Unless this is a long exposure/something, not quite sure how you achieved this effect.</td>', '3 - Colors look quite nice, but perhaps a tweaking, especially of the yellow - ''brighter'' make this better in my opinion.  Overall, not sure on the crop, looks like the top half is missing.  Some grain/noise issues on the outer areas of frame.  Unless this is a long exposure/something, not quite sure how you achieved this effect.', '2006-04-27 22:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351944, 324331, 12857, '<td valign="top">I definately see this photo in a magazine.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'I definately see this photo in a magazine.  Keep up the good work!', '2006-04-27 22:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
