(2351950, 325162, 53164, '<td valign="top">but the wing looks yellow....or is it my monitor?</td>', 'but the wing looks yellow....or is it my monitor?', '2006-04-27 22:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351951, 325391, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Made a comment, but seems it didn''t ''stick''.  Like this and whilst like to see less green, does get lost because of the dominant yellow in my opinion.  A more refined crop make this even better, again, my opinion.  Like that the ant has a slight purple ''tint'' to it.</td>', '7 - Made a comment, but seems it didn''t ''stick''.  Like this and whilst like to see less green, does get lost because of the dominant yellow in my opinion.  A more refined crop make this even better, again, my opinion.  Like that the ant has a slight purple ''tint'' to it.', '2006-04-27 22:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2351952, 326231, 12857, '<td valign="top">Great concept and Great photo.  This one should be on a stock photo website.  I am  sure you would sell thousands of them.  Good job and great focus.  The DOF is perfect<br/>dc</td>', 'Great concept and Great photo.  This one should be on a stock photo website.  I am  sure you would sell thousands of them.  Good job and great focus.  The DOF is perfectdc', '2006-04-27 22:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
