(2352526, 324940, 49667, '<td valign="top">One of the reasons I didn''t enter this challenge was because I was not creative enough to think of a picture that exhibited complementary colors and didn''t involve a flower...  I see that you too have failed at at least one of these, but a nice picture none-the-less. 3</td>', 'One of the reasons I didn''t enter this challenge was because I was not creative enough to think of a picture that exhibited complementary colors and didn''t involve a flower...  I see that you too have failed at at least one of these, but a nice picture none-the-less. 3', '2006-04-28 02:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
