(2352539, 325970, 49667, '<td valign="top">At first I thought, "very nice", then I saw the angular distortion in the sides, and top, of the photo... My guess is that you didn''t frame the picture on the side black lines for the very reason of minimizing this distortion.  Had you pointed the camera perfectly perpendicular to the subject, on all axis, then you would have come out with a winning photo in my book. 6</td>', 'At first I thought, "very nice", then I saw the angular distortion in the sides, and top, of the photo... My guess is that you didn''t frame the picture on the side black lines for the very reason of minimizing this distortion.  Had you pointed the camera perfectly perpendicular to the subject, on all axis, then you would have come out with a winning photo in my book. 6', '2006-04-28 03:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352542, 323279, 49667, '<td valign="top">I like the lights here, but the photo isn''t as sharp as it could have been, and it is a bit dark too. 4</td>', 'I like the lights here, but the photo isn''t as sharp as it could have been, and it is a bit dark too. 4', '2006-04-28 03:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352545, 325073, 49667, '<td valign="top">One of the reasons I didn''t enter this challenge was because I was not creative enough to think of a picture that exhibited complementary colors and didn''t involve a flower...  I see that you too have failed at at least one of these...  There is too much brown in the picture. 3</td>', 'One of the reasons I didn''t enter this challenge was because I was not creative enough to think of a picture that exhibited complementary colors and didn''t involve a flower...  I see that you too have failed at at least one of these...  There is too much brown in the picture. 3', '2006-04-28 03:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352546, 323773, 32885, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I like the contrast of space. Well done.</td>', 'Nice image. I like the contrast of space. Well done.', '2006-04-28 03:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352547, 326360, 49667, '<td valign="top">Softer light, apples filling the frame, and if it were a bit sharper along with a touch more contrast, you would have won me over.  This photo meets the challenge, but falls short of being a #1. 4</td>', 'Softer light, apples filling the frame, and if it were a bit sharper along with a touch more contrast, you would have won me over.  This photo meets the challenge, but falls short of being a #1. 4', '2006-04-28 03:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352551, 326056, 49667, '<td valign="top">There is a bit of a color cast in this photo, which is usually the case when a lot of red abounds the frame.  Scott Kelby has a section in his book, "The Photoshop Book for Digitral Photographers", that addresses this very issue using "threshold" and curves; setting the black, white and grey points.  I would have liked the photo more without the color cast, and with a touch more contrast to bring out the color of purple; the red is too dominating. 3</td>', 'There is a bit of a color cast in this photo, which is usually the case when a lot of red abounds the frame.  Scott Kelby has a section in his book, "The Photoshop Book for Digitral Photographers", that addresses this very issue using "threshold" and curves; setting the black, white and grey points.  I would have liked the photo more without the color cast, and with a touch more contrast to bring out the color of purple; the red is too dominating. 3', '2006-04-28 03:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352552, 326515, 49667, '<td valign="top">One of the reasons I didn''t enter this challenge was because I was not creative enough to think of a picture that exhibited complementary colors and didn''t involve a flower...  I see that you too have failed at both of these. 1</td>', 'One of the reasons I didn''t enter this challenge was because I was not creative enough to think of a picture that exhibited complementary colors and didn''t involve a flower...  I see that you too have failed at both of these. 1', '2006-04-28 03:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352553, 323814, 49667, '<td valign="top">There is noise in the green, which happens quite a bit on my 20D where there is not enough light.  The yellow, while it is kind of intersting, gets in the way of the subject of the picture... Had you made the yellow a part of the subject, as opposed to a supporting layer of the subject, then you would have scored higher with me. 2</td>', 'There is noise in the green, which happens quite a bit on my 20D where there is not enough light.  The yellow, while it is kind of intersting, gets in the way of the subject of the picture... Had you made the yellow a part of the subject, as opposed to a supporting layer of the subject, then you would have scored higher with me. 2', '2006-04-28 03:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352554, 323459, 49667, '<td valign="top">I think that if you had not had the dip in the bowel, then you would have had an excellent picture here.  The dullness of the dip takes away from the robustness of the chips.  The chips and the bowel alone would have received a solid 10 from me.  It does look tasty though.  7</td>', 'I think that if you had not had the dip in the bowel, then you would have had an excellent picture here.  The dullness of the dip takes away from the robustness of the chips.  The chips and the bowel alone would have received a solid 10 from me.  It does look tasty though.  7', '2006-04-28 03:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352556, 325540, 32885, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF and clarity of this image.</td>', 'I like the DOF and clarity of this image.', '2006-04-28 03:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352557, 326591, 32885, '<td valign="top">It is a shame that the subject is largely out of focus.</td>', 'It is a shame that the subject is largely out of focus.', '2006-04-28 03:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352558, 326475, 49667, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet to the point and robust all at the same time.  You have created the perfect photo for this challenge receiving a well deserved 10.</td>', 'Simple, yet to the point and robust all at the same time.  You have created the perfect photo for this challenge receiving a well deserved 10.', '2006-04-28 03:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352560, 326038, 49667, '<td valign="top">The bright white in this photo takes away from the impact I think you were trying to achieve. 6</td>', 'The bright white in this photo takes away from the impact I think you were trying to achieve. 6', '2006-04-28 03:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352561, 325432, 49667, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry... While this does meet the challenge, you have failed, like many photographers do when trying to capture that "magic hour" photo, in taking a photo that was clear, yet breathtaking.  It sort of looks like you held the camera out of your car window while driving down the road. 3</td>', 'I''m sorry... While this does meet the challenge, you have failed, like many photographers do when trying to capture that "magic hour" photo, in taking a photo that was clear, yet breathtaking.  It sort of looks like you held the camera out of your car window while driving down the road. 3', '2006-04-28 03:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352563, 325468, 49667, '<td valign="top">One of the reasons I didn''t enter this challenge was because I was not creative enough to think of a picture that exhibited complementary colors and didn''t involve a flower...  I see that you too have failed at at least one of these.  Your flash, or whatever light source, bleached the color on the pinkish red of the upper-most leaf...  A bit more contrast, softer light, along with a little cropping of the dead vegetation would have produced a decent photograph. 4</td>', 'One of the reasons I didn''t enter this challenge was because I was not creative enough to think of a picture that exhibited complementary colors and didn''t involve a flower...  I see that you too have failed at at least one of these.  Your flash, or whatever light source, bleached the color on the pinkish red of the upper-most leaf...  A bit more contrast, softer light, along with a little cropping of the dead vegetation would have produced a decent photograph. 4', '2006-04-28 03:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352569, 326252, 49667, '<td valign="top">I''m looking hard for the complementary colors here.  Nice shot though. 2</td>', 'I''m looking hard for the complementary colors here.  Nice shot though. 2', '2006-04-28 03:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352572, 325331, 49667, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, but you overdid it with the lights... Too harsh on the lights, a bit softer would have allowed the colors to produce a contrast that would command a 10 from me, but you need some serious work on the lighting. 8</td>', 'Very nice shot, but you overdid it with the lights... Too harsh on the lights, a bit softer would have allowed the colors to produce a contrast that would command a 10 from me, but you need some serious work on the lighting. 8', '2006-04-28 03:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
