(2352605, 325449, 49667, '<td valign="top">Kinda boring in contrast to what I have seen thus far, but you have met the challenge, and have mastered the lighting in this photo.  Though I really don''t like the subject, the technical details of the photo certainly command a 9.  Nice job and good luck.</td>', 'Kinda boring in contrast to what I have seen thus far, but you have met the challenge, and have mastered the lighting in this photo.  Though I really don''t like the subject, the technical details of the photo certainly command a 9.  Nice job and good luck.', '2006-04-28 03:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352608, 326096, 49667, '<td valign="top">LOL @ the title.  Actually, you have pulled this off nicely.  I understand the negativity, but I just don''t like the whiteness in the photo. 8</td>', 'LOL @ the title.  Actually, you have pulled this off nicely.  I understand the negativity, but I just don''t like the whiteness in the photo. 8', '2006-04-28 03:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352609, 325978, 32885, '<td valign="top">I like this image. It is one of the better ones in this challenge. Perhaps a little too bright. IMHO it could be toned down a bit.</td>', 'I like this image. It is one of the better ones in this challenge. Perhaps a little too bright. IMHO it could be toned down a bit.', '2006-04-28 03:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352611, 325964, 32885, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. Such expression on the dog''s face.</td>', 'I like this photo. Such expression on the dog''s face.', '2006-04-28 03:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352612, 326499, 32885, '<td valign="top">Well done on a ''different'' image. I love the concept and the clarity.</td>', 'Well done on a ''different'' image. I love the concept and the clarity.', '2006-04-28 03:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352619, 325868, 49667, '<td valign="top">This photo leaves a lot to be desired in contrast to some of the other photos in this challenge...  You have met the challenge nicely, but by putting her as the main subject you have also taken away from the challenge at the same time... On a side note, her face is a bit bleached on the one side. 6</td>', 'This photo leaves a lot to be desired in contrast to some of the other photos in this challenge...  You have met the challenge nicely, but by putting her as the main subject you have also taken away from the challenge at the same time... On a side note, her face is a bit bleached on the one side. 6', '2006-04-28 04:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352631, 326074, 49667, '<td valign="top">There is a significant amount of noise in this photo... The light peering through is also a bit distracting along with the out of focusness. 3</td>', 'There is a significant amount of noise in this photo... The light peering through is also a bit distracting along with the out of focusness. 3', '2006-04-28 04:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352633, 325500, 49667, '<td valign="top">Simple, to the point, effectively meets the challenge nicely. 9</td>', 'Simple, to the point, effectively meets the challenge nicely. 9', '2006-04-28 04:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352634, 324236, 49667, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo, but I would have liked to see more purple... the yellow-ish color is very dominating. 6</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo, but I would have liked to see more purple... the yellow-ish color is very dominating. 6', '2006-04-28 04:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352636, 324798, 49667, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, but I would have liked to see more of the green be lighter to be in better contrast to the bright red.  Aside from the challenge, this photo does well at singling out the subject and creating sort of a calming effect. 7</td>', 'This is a nice photo, but I would have liked to see more of the green be lighter to be in better contrast to the bright red.  Aside from the challenge, this photo does well at singling out the subject and creating sort of a calming effect. 7', '2006-04-28 04:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352637, 324981, 49667, '<td valign="top">The flash spot, or whatever that light is, is distracting and takes away from the photo.  Had you not had this in the picture, yet been able to capture the same contrasting colors then you would have a very nice image. 7</td>', 'The flash spot, or whatever that light is, is distracting and takes away from the photo.  Had you not had this in the picture, yet been able to capture the same contrasting colors then you would have a very nice image. 7', '2006-04-28 04:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352638, 326146, 49667, '<td valign="top">I don''t get this photo at all... I am searching and searching, but cannot see the color. 1</td>', 'I don''t get this photo at all... I am searching and searching, but cannot see the color. 1', '2006-04-28 04:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352639, 326439, 49667, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a similar image somewhere else on the site...  points taken away for lack of originality, but you have met the challenge nicely.6</td>', 'I''ve seen a similar image somewhere else on the site...  points taken away for lack of originality, but you have met the challenge nicely.6', '2006-04-28 04:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352640, 324708, 49667, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, really, but we''re missing another color here. 2</td>', 'Nice shot, really, but we''re missing another color here. 2', '2006-04-28 04:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352641, 325892, 49667, '<td valign="top">The green in this shot is bland... Less, or no, flash would have possibly created a more vibrant contrast between the two colors in the frame.  Nice try. 4</td>', 'The green in this shot is bland... Less, or no, flash would have possibly created a more vibrant contrast between the two colors in the frame.  Nice try. 4', '2006-04-28 04:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352645, 324666, 49667, '<td valign="top">There is a ton of noise in the photo, A TON!  Also, and in my opinion, borders are used for photos where the photo doesnt'' do the job of properly representing itself.  I actually take points off for the border.  The composition is nice, but too much noise and that darn border. 2</td>', 'There is a ton of noise in the photo, A TON!  Also, and in my opinion, borders are used for photos where the photo doesnt'' do the job of properly representing itself.  I actually take points off for the border.  The composition is nice, but too much noise and that darn border. 2', '2006-04-28 04:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352648, 324309, 49667, '<td valign="top">I know that the red should really be an orange... Why it didn''t turn out that way is beyond me... Had the orange been orange, had less noise been in the photo, and had the border been scrapped, then I would have voted higher than the 2 I give this.  I didn''t even mention the lack of sharpness.</td>', 'I know that the red should really be an orange... Why it didn''t turn out that way is beyond me... Had the orange been orange, had less noise been in the photo, and had the border been scrapped, then I would have voted higher than the 2 I give this.  I didn''t even mention the lack of sharpness.', '2006-04-28 04:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352652, 326046, 49667, '<td valign="top">I tried to wipe the dust off of my monitor... I then realized that it was in the picture.  Had you also chose dice that had perfect paint, to go along with the perfectness of the photo, then I would have to give this photo a 10.  Unfortunately, and due to the aforementioned pitfalls, I give it a 6.</td>', 'I tried to wipe the dust off of my monitor... I then realized that it was in the picture.  Had you also chose dice that had perfect paint, to go along with the perfectness of the photo, then I would have to give this photo a 10.  Unfortunately, and due to the aforementioned pitfalls, I give it a 6.', '2006-04-28 04:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352654, 324633, 49667, '<td valign="top">I give you a 10 for such an original photo that meets the challenge exceptionally well.  Unfortuantely, I take 1 point off due to the netural road having such a presence in the photo.  I know... You couldn''t help it really, but a 9 is pretty darn good from me.</td>', 'I give you a 10 for such an original photo that meets the challenge exceptionally well.  Unfortuantely, I take 1 point off due to the netural road having such a presence in the photo.  I know... You couldn''t help it really, but a 9 is pretty darn good from me.', '2006-04-28 04:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352656, 326481, 49667, '<td valign="top">One of the reasons I didn''t enter this challenge was because I was not creative enough to think of a picture that exhibited complementary colors and didn''t involve a flower...  I see that you too have failed at at least one of these, but a nice picture none-the-less. 7</td>', 'One of the reasons I didn''t enter this challenge was because I was not creative enough to think of a picture that exhibited complementary colors and didn''t involve a flower...  I see that you too have failed at at least one of these, but a nice picture none-the-less. 7', '2006-04-28 04:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352657, 326078, 49667, '<td valign="top">The color cast in this photo is overwhelming to me.  There is also a ton of noise in the photo.  If you don''t see this, then I would suggest calibrating your monitor; the bananna has a red tint to it. 1</td>', 'The color cast in this photo is overwhelming to me.  There is also a ton of noise in the photo.  If you don''t see this, then I would suggest calibrating your monitor; the bananna has a red tint to it. 1', '2006-04-28 04:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352658, 324609, 32885, '<td valign="top">This is different. Well done.</td>', 'This is different. Well done.', '2006-04-28 04:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352659, 325740, 49667, '<td valign="top">Very nice. A cooler light may have kept the robustness of the green in the upper portions of the bamboo.  9</td>', 'Very nice. A cooler light may have kept the robustness of the green in the upper portions of the bamboo.  9', '2006-04-28 04:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352662, 326076, 49667, '<td valign="top">This is very wild!  It looks like an artist used finger paint on a blue board.  Unfortunately, Orange is the complement to blue so there is a bit of a stretch there. 3</td>', 'This is very wild!  It looks like an artist used finger paint on a blue board.  Unfortunately, Orange is the complement to blue so there is a bit of a stretch there. 3', '2006-04-28 04:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352663, 325813, 49667, '<td valign="top">This photo is a bit bland.  I need to see more contrast.  Also, had you put the moon closer to a thirds line intersection, then you would have added a little more to the photo without really taking away from the point of the challenge. 4</td>', 'This photo is a bit bland.  I need to see more contrast.  Also, had you put the moon closer to a thirds line intersection, then you would have added a little more to the photo without really taking away from the point of the challenge. 4', '2006-04-28 04:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352665, 325512, 49667, '<td valign="top">This photo is a bit out of focus and too dark for my taste. 3</td>', 'This photo is a bit out of focus and too dark for my taste. 3', '2006-04-28 04:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352666, 325966, 49667, '<td valign="top">I feel this photo lacks sharpness and is a bit oversaturated.  The rocks seem to be more red and pink than orange.  Nice shot. 6</td>', 'I feel this photo lacks sharpness and is a bit oversaturated.  The rocks seem to be more red and pink than orange.  Nice shot. 6', '2006-04-28 04:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352693, 324615, 44751, '<td valign="top">Nice cardboard cutout!</td>', 'Nice cardboard cutout!', '2006-04-28 05:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352714, 326150, 52549, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Focus could be better.</td>', 'Good idea. Focus could be better.', '2006-04-28 06:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352715, 325396, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very nice and crisp looking, however the saucer (and the rear cup) are orange on my monitor.</td>', 'Very nice and crisp looking, however the saucer (and the rear cup) are orange on my monitor.', '2006-04-28 06:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352717, 326345, 52549, '<td valign="top">Like the placing of the rose in the picture, it could use a touch more focus tho.</td>', 'Like the placing of the rose in the picture, it could use a touch more focus tho.', '2006-04-28 06:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352718, 326330, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great colours and composition. Unusual and interesting. Love the sky.</td>', 'Great colours and composition. Unusual and interesting. Love the sky.', '2006-04-28 06:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352724, 326579, 52549, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, however I think this could have been improved by not placing the tulips at the outer edges and having the background completely green. Great bokeh.</td>', 'Nice colours, however I think this could have been improved by not placing the tulips at the outer edges and having the background completely green. Great bokeh.', '2006-04-28 06:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352725, 326095, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, amazing eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful image, amazing eyes.', '2006-04-28 06:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352728, 326403, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great poster material. I could imagine it looking good hung up on a bistro wall.</td>', 'Great poster material. I could imagine it looking good hung up on a bistro wall.', '2006-04-28 06:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352729, 326351, 52549, '<td valign="top">Cool and subtle.</td>', 'Cool and subtle.', '2006-04-28 06:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352772, 325331, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - ''Meets the Challenge'' enough, composition is quite good, concept lacks a little, even with the seemingly painted beak, in my opinion.  Blown areas from the lighting detract, but fairly minor.</td>', '5 - ''Meets the Challenge'' enough, composition is quite good, concept lacks a little, even with the seemingly painted beak, in my opinion.  Blown areas from the lighting detract, but fairly minor.', '2006-04-28 07:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352773, 326495, 18073, '<td valign="top">Great image, lots of nice detail and nice competition.  My only issue would be that it could do with just a touch more saturation to make the colours leap out a bit more, but that would be nit picking.<br/> <br/>Good luck with this its fabulous!</td>', 'Great image, lots of nice detail and nice competition.  My only issue would be that it could do with just a touch more saturation to make the colours leap out a bit more, but that would be nit picking. Good luck with this its fabulous!', '2006-04-28 07:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352777, 326395, 18073, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  This should do well I think.  Nice colours, bags of detail and on the money exposure, well done to you!  Would be keen to know how you lit this (flash or natural light?)  Good luck, this has top 5 finish all over it!</td>', 'Great shot.  This should do well I think.  Nice colours, bags of detail and on the money exposure, well done to you!  Would be keen to know how you lit this (flash or natural light?)  Good luck, this has top 5 finish all over it!', '2006-04-28 07:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352789, 323773, 50147, '<td valign="top">I do like this quite a lot but maybe would have cut back on the green from the top just a bit</td>', 'I do like this quite a lot but maybe would have cut back on the green from the top just a bit', '2006-04-28 07:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352798, 324462, 50147, '<td valign="top">I really like the photo but no so keen on the border</td>', 'I really like the photo but no so keen on the border', '2006-04-28 07:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2352808, 326495, 36606, '<td valign="top">very very cool/ love it! ribbon?</td>', 'very very cool/ love it! ribbon?', '2006-04-28 08:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
