(2353113, 326410, 35947, '<td valign="top">Image is small and cluttered.  No main focal point.  Keep trying and submiting though!</td>', 'Image is small and cluttered.  No main focal point.  Keep trying and submiting though!', '2006-04-28 11:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
