(2353124, 325410, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great set-up/composition but I''m not sure how this fits the challenge unless my screen is too dark and needs recalibrated again.</td>', 'Great set-up/composition but I''m not sure how this fits the challenge unless my screen is too dark and needs recalibrated again.', '2006-04-28 11:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
