(2354426, 325443, 41522, '<td valign="top">I see the complementary Red/Green.  The lighting on this image is too dark for my liking.  JMO</td>', 'I see the complementary Red/Green.  The lighting on this image is too dark for my liking.  JMO', '2006-04-28 21:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354427, 324385, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. Interesting backround.</td>', 'Nicely composed. Interesting backround.', '2006-04-28 21:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354430, 326076, 3306, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. You probably would have done better in a different challenge because the viewer will have a difficult time determining which Complementary colors you are demonstrating. Good picture though.</td>', 'Love the colors. You probably would have done better in a different challenge because the viewer will have a difficult time determining which Complementary colors you are demonstrating. Good picture though.', '2006-04-28 21:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354540, 326110, 52074, '<td valign="top">Really like the offset design. Everything is pulled together in my eye. Color combo is one of my favorites also</td>', 'Really like the offset design. Everything is pulled together in my eye. Color combo is one of my favorites also', '2006-04-28 22:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354543, 324633, 52074, '<td valign="top">Really like this angle,the road seems to pull you right to the end. Love the colors.</td>', 'Really like this angle,the road seems to pull you right to the end. Love the colors.', '2006-04-28 22:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354544, 325980, 52074, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Looks like a mouth opening up. The brightness of the green is a little distracting away from the flower itself tho, to my eye.</td>', 'Interesting. Looks like a mouth opening up. The brightness of the green is a little distracting away from the flower itself tho, to my eye.', '2006-04-28 22:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354548, 326046, 52074, '<td valign="top">Really like the clarity of the dice, would have been nice to clone out the spots on the base, but like how it brightens from the bottom up</td>', 'Really like the clarity of the dice, would have been nice to clone out the spots on the base, but like how it brightens from the bottom up', '2006-04-28 22:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354553, 325088, 52074, '<td valign="top">I really like the color choice for the vase and the flowers. Found myself tilting my head as the vase is leaning to the left. My eyes keep going to the hot spots on the vase. Overall, I enjoyed looking at the concept.</td>', 'I really like the color choice for the vase and the flowers. Found myself tilting my head as the vase is leaning to the left. My eyes keep going to the hot spots on the vase. Overall, I enjoyed looking at the concept.', '2006-04-28 22:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354558, 324947, 52074, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast and mixture of color and flowers. Good choice. I like the shapes of the petals put together. Good job.  Very soft to look at, and I think the water  really makes it.</td>', 'Very nice contrast and mixture of color and flowers. Good choice. I like the shapes of the petals put together. Good job.  Very soft to look at, and I think the water  really makes it.', '2006-04-28 22:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354563, 323952, 52074, '<td valign="top">Have to say this is a favorite.  The colors in the leaf, love that it is upside down, and the contrast of the reflections from the water pull this together nicely. Great job.</td>', 'Have to say this is a favorite.  The colors in the leaf, love that it is upside down, and the contrast of the reflections from the water pull this together nicely. Great job.', '2006-04-28 22:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354568, 325401, 52074, '<td valign="top">Nice soft touch here.  Very good focus. I get told often that i center things to much, but here you can see there is beauty in symmetry.  Very nice.</td>', 'Nice soft touch here.  Very good focus. I get told often that i center things to much, but here you can see there is beauty in symmetry.  Very nice.', '2006-04-28 22:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354573, 324582, 52074, '<td valign="top">OOOOOPPPS!</td>', 'OOOOOPPPS!', '2006-04-28 22:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354576, 325973, 52074, '<td valign="top">I would frame this and put it on my wall! Love the offset composition, feel like it''s peeping around the corner at me! The noise is the green really sets it off as well.</td>', 'I would frame this and put it on my wall! Love the offset composition, feel like it''s peeping around the corner at me! The noise is the green really sets it off as well.', '2006-04-28 22:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354580, 324901, 52074, '<td valign="top">Really drawn to the clarity of the orange and the distribution of clouds in the background. Such a simple shot, yet very eye appealing. LIKE IT!</td>', 'Really drawn to the clarity of the orange and the distribution of clouds in the background. Such a simple shot, yet very eye appealing. LIKE IT!', '2006-04-28 22:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354588, 326058, 52074, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity here, the red, green and white make this a nice pic, however, the brightness on the bottom right is a little distracting to my personal eye.</td>', 'I like the simplicity here, the red, green and white make this a nice pic, however, the brightness on the bottom right is a little distracting to my personal eye.', '2006-04-28 22:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354592, 325396, 52074, '<td valign="top">Nice pick of colors together, very soft and quaint and really like the DOF, but I am quirky about things that are tilting.</td>', 'Nice pick of colors together, very soft and quaint and really like the DOF, but I am quirky about things that are tilting.', '2006-04-28 22:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354599, 324469, 52074, '<td valign="top">Very eye appealing shot. Love the idea and the darkness surrounding it. Like the hot spot on the top as well.</td>', 'Very eye appealing shot. Love the idea and the darkness surrounding it. Like the hot spot on the top as well.', '2006-04-28 22:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354611, 326487, 52074, '<td valign="top">Really caught my eye when I flipped to this. The only thing is I kept seeing that spot on the leaf. Knowing that there propbably aren''t too many perfect leaves to a plant, would have been nice to be able to clone that out. Nice crop and darjened corners bring it out even more. Nice.</td>', 'Really caught my eye when I flipped to this. The only thing is I kept seeing that spot on the leaf. Knowing that there propbably aren''t too many perfect leaves to a plant, would have been nice to be able to clone that out. Nice crop and darjened corners bring it out even more. Nice.', '2006-04-28 22:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354613, 326414, 52074, '<td valign="top">I am a flower-shot lover, despite all the threads of people complaining about how many they see in challenges. I would enjoy this more if the focal point were more on the flower and not the stem.</td>', 'I am a flower-shot lover, despite all the threads of people complaining about how many they see in challenges. I would enjoy this more if the focal point were more on the flower and not the stem.', '2006-04-28 22:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354623, 326018, 52074, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, and the colors blend well, as well as the matching border. I found myself squinting to read the ribbons tho.</td>', 'I like this idea, and the colors blend well, as well as the matching border. I found myself squinting to read the ribbons tho.', '2006-04-28 22:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354627, 325541, 52074, '<td valign="top">Really like this crop...colors blend very well, and to MY eye, the shadows add much to it.</td>', 'Really like this crop...colors blend very well, and to MY eye, the shadows add much to it.', '2006-04-28 22:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354634, 325175, 52074, '<td valign="top">One of my favs.  Love this done on the black background, the scarcity of the water drops look "just right" and lovely colors together.</td>', 'One of my favs.  Love this done on the black background, the scarcity of the water drops look "just right" and lovely colors together.', '2006-04-28 22:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354639, 326491, 52074, '<td valign="top">Nice work and effort here. Kudos to your model . With the glasses pulled down, would have liked to see the colors carried up to the bottom of the eyes. That flesh area stuck out to me, but I''m sure she had had enough at that point. :O) One of my favs. 8</td>', 'Nice work and effort here. Kudos to your model . With the glasses pulled down, would have liked to see the colors carried up to the bottom of the eyes. That flesh area stuck out to me, but I''m sure she had had enough at that point. :O) One of my favs. 8', '2006-04-28 23:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354649, 324280, 52074, '<td valign="top">How nice and soft. I just love spring! Good DOF for this shot. I would mat this with a matching yellow and frame it in old barnwood frame. Good job.</td>', 'How nice and soft. I just love spring! Good DOF for this shot. I would mat this with a matching yellow and frame it in old barnwood frame. Good job.', '2006-04-28 23:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354658, 323636, 52074, '<td valign="top">Great!  The brightness of the background makes it feel as tho you could reach out and grab that flower.  Nice choice of color and amount of water.</td>', 'Great!  The brightness of the background makes it feel as tho you could reach out and grab that flower.  Nice choice of color and amount of water.', '2006-04-28 23:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354871, 326128, 42506, '<td valign="top">I love this! Wonderful creative idea fro from flowers / vegetables / fruits. Didn''t see that little splash from the thumbnail and was v pleasantly surprised. lol such a cool idea and title. Only suggestion would have been for the umbrella to be "more orange" but this is great. 9</td>', 'I love this! Wonderful creative idea fro from flowers / vegetables / fruits. Didn''t see that little splash from the thumbnail and was v pleasantly surprised. lol such a cool idea and title. Only suggestion would have been for the umbrella to be "more orange" but this is great. 9', '2006-04-29 00:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354877, 323807, 42506, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2006-04-29 00:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354882, 323610, 42506, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Creative entry.</td>', 'Nice idea. Creative entry.', '2006-04-29 00:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354898, 326374, 42506, '<td valign="top">One of the better flow shots for sure. I like the fact this is up close yet makes good use of the negative (blue) space. DOF could potentially be a little stronger for my liking but is also good as is.</td>', 'One of the better flow shots for sure. I like the fact this is up close yet makes good use of the negative (blue) space. DOF could potentially be a little stronger for my liking but is also good as is.', '2006-04-29 00:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354902, 326046, 42506, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Nice simple idea well executed.</td>', 'Great shot. Nice simple idea well executed.', '2006-04-29 00:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354905, 324592, 42506, '<td valign="top">My favourite of the vege shots. You might have gotten some comments about people not liking the crop (my guess, could be totally wrong) but I think the framing is great here. I like the mild vignetting also.</td>', 'My favourite of the vege shots. You might have gotten some comments about people not liking the crop (my guess, could be totally wrong) but I think the framing is great here. I like the mild vignetting also.', '2006-04-29 00:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354920, 323938, 32644, '<td valign="top">Sharper please</td>', 'Sharper please', '2006-04-29 00:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354936, 325880, 5792, '<td valign="top">Top 3. Superb still life. Color, lighting and framing are top notch. Very high technical quality. Use of the mirror and misting the peppers are perfect added value additions to the composition.</td>', 'Top 3. Superb still life. Color, lighting and framing are top notch. Very high technical quality. Use of the mirror and misting the peppers are perfect added value additions to the composition.', '2006-04-29 01:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354962, 324586, 5792, '<td valign="top">Top 3. Nicely conceived and setup variation of this oft taken still life. Exceptional framing color and technical quality. Beautifully done.</td>', 'Top 3. Nicely conceived and setup variation of this oft taken still life. Exceptional framing color and technical quality. Beautifully done.', '2006-04-29 01:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354963, 325868, 18403, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! I think the white frame may detract somewhat.</td>', 'Gorgeous! I think the white frame may detract somewhat.', '2006-04-29 01:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354965, 326333, 18403, '<td valign="top">Exquisite!  Best use of color I have yet seen!</td>', 'Exquisite!  Best use of color I have yet seen!', '2006-04-29 01:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354994, 323604, 38032, '<td valign="top">My first year of enjoying tulips - very nice</td>', 'My first year of enjoying tulips - very nice', '2006-04-29 01:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2354997, 325483, 38032, '<td valign="top">focal issues hurt this ... it is oddly interesting though</td>', 'focal issues hurt this ... it is oddly interesting though', '2006-04-29 01:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355002, 326395, 38032, '<td valign="top">refreshing in 2 ways.  8</td>', 'refreshing in 2 ways.  8', '2006-04-29 01:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355003, 325616, 52074, '<td valign="top">10! 10! 10!<br/> <br/>One of the best photos I''ve seen in some time. Everything from the bits of sand around the mouth, the wayward strands of hair, beautiful color of the eye, the pose, the crop.....I am new to the mechanics of photography and editing in PS. I question my worthiness at times to issue critiques.  Those pics that I have entered that I thought were great, landing 3''s,  4''s and 5''s, are the stepping stones to my learning to create something just as this.But I have learned enough so far to know when something "pops", and this is a stick of dynamite!!!  Wonderful job!</td>', '10! 10! 10! One of the best photos I''ve seen in some time. Everything from the bits of sand around the mouth, the wayward strands of hair, beautiful color of the eye, the pose, the crop.....I am new to the mechanics of photography and editing in PS. I question my worthiness at times to issue critiques.  Those pics that I have entered that I thought were great, landing 3''s,  4''s and 5''s, are the stepping stones to my learning to create something just as this.But I have learned enough so far to know when something "pops", and this is a stick of dynamite!!!  Wonderful job!', '2006-04-29 01:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355005, 326529, 38032, '<td valign="top">Fewer reflections would be a little nicer</td>', 'Fewer reflections would be a little nicer', '2006-04-29 01:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355010, 326351, 38032, '<td valign="top">Nice macro effect</td>', 'Nice macro effect', '2006-04-29 01:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355012, 325868, 5792, '<td valign="top">Top 3. Tough guess in a challenge with a lot of great images clustered near the top. Yours has a carefree elegance about it. Your setup and the simplicity of the composition is its strength. Well posed model and the technicals in this one are fine.</td>', 'Top 3. Tough guess in a challenge with a lot of great images clustered near the top. Yours has a carefree elegance about it. Your setup and the simplicity of the composition is its strength. Well posed model and the technicals in this one are fine.', '2006-04-29 01:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355013, 325182, 38032, '<td valign="top">seems a little crazy- but interesting</td>', 'seems a little crazy- but interesting', '2006-04-29 01:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355014, 326441, 38032, '<td valign="top">intriguing</td>', 'intriguing', '2006-04-29 01:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355016, 325530, 52074, '<td valign="top">Really like this, the color and contrast of the blinds really accents the subject, but the angle of them vs. the angle of the table is distracting to me.</td>', 'Really like this, the color and contrast of the blinds really accents the subject, but the angle of them vs. the angle of the table is distracting to me.', '2006-04-29 01:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355018, 324609, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like the water ...the fish isn''t detailed enough to make it worth throwing around a fish</td>', 'I like the water ...the fish isn''t detailed enough to make it worth throwing around a fish', '2006-04-29 01:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355020, 326144, 38032, '<td valign="top">A little crispness needed.</td>', 'A little crispness needed.', '2006-04-29 01:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355023, 324109, 38032, '<td valign="top">A yes ... an art study .. simple yet affective</td>', 'A yes ... an art study .. simple yet affective', '2006-04-29 01:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355026, 323701, 52074, '<td valign="top">Have to admit, didn''t really like this at all when I viewed it the first time. But as I returned and looked again, and again, the sparkle within the flower and reflection of light with the water drops keeps drawing me in. Interesting view for me..</td>', 'Have to admit, didn''t really like this at all when I viewed it the first time. But as I returned and looked again, and again, the sparkle within the flower and reflection of light with the water drops keeps drawing me in. Interesting view for me..', '2006-04-29 01:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355029, 325530, 38032, '<td valign="top">i like the texture here but the overall composition is awkward</td>', 'i like the texture here but the overall composition is awkward', '2006-04-29 01:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355031, 326477, 38032, '<td valign="top">lighting is nice here</td>', 'lighting is nice here', '2006-04-29 01:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355033, 324190, 52074, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF, good balance, sharp. This would have look great with some droplets</td>', 'Very nice DOF, good balance, sharp. This would have look great with some droplets', '2006-04-29 01:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355037, 326078, 38032, '<td valign="top">velvet underground - I like it.</td>', 'velvet underground - I like it.', '2006-04-29 01:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355042, 326499, 52074, '<td valign="top">Great idea! What a perfect outcome of the liquid trail</td>', 'Great idea! What a perfect outcome of the liquid trail', '2006-04-29 01:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355048, 326272, 52074, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of DOF...nice soft colors. I like how the background blends with the colors in the flowers. Flows very nicely for me</td>', 'Very nice use of DOF...nice soft colors. I like how the background blends with the colors in the flowers. Flows very nicely for me', '2006-04-29 01:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355058, 326576, 52074, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of flowers too use. Love the darkness about this overall. Very unperfectly  mixture of petal shapes.</td>', 'Nice choice of flowers too use. Love the darkness about this overall. Very unperfectly  mixture of petal shapes.', '2006-04-29 01:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355063, 326495, 6179, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2006-04-29 01:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355085, 325483, 5792, '<td valign="top">There is nothing wrong with your concept. It is a good idea. The technical execution of this image is its main fault. It lacks clarity and has some serious digital artifacting in the composition. Overall color and contrast are weak. You might consider shooting this from a different perspective, like from ground level or straight down from above with the red-green boundary absolutely horizotal or vertical in the frame. This is kind of a "snapshot" perspective.<br/> <br/>I''m guessing you are not very experienced with image post processing. I don''t know what editor you are using but you will want to learn as much as possible about it and use it to bring out the best in your pictures.</td>', 'There is nothing wrong with your concept. It is a good idea. The technical execution of this image is its main fault. It lacks clarity and has some serious digital artifacting in the composition. Overall color and contrast are weak. You might consider shooting this from a different perspective, like from ground level or straight down from above with the red-green boundary absolutely horizotal or vertical in the frame. This is kind of a "snapshot" perspective. I''m guessing you are not very experienced with image post processing. I don''t know what editor you are using but you will want to learn as much as possible about it and use it to bring out the best in your pictures.', '2006-04-29 01:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355118, 326058, 38921, '<td valign="top">Simple (in a good way) and excellently executed.</td>', 'Simple (in a good way) and excellently executed.', '2006-04-29 01:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355123, 326410, 38921, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see how this meets the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t really see how this meets the challenge.', '2006-04-29 01:57:48.000000', NULL, 1);
