(2356818, 326591, 43516, '<td valign="top">Its hard to get insects nice and sharp but not impossible.  This would be improved by having the entire thing being sharp.  Fill flash is often handy for freezing fast moving insects.</td>', 'Its hard to get insects nice and sharp but not impossible.  This would be improved by having the entire thing being sharp.  Fill flash is often handy for freezing fast moving insects.', '2006-04-29 11:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
