(2359347, 323372, 41522, '<td valign="top">You definitely have met the challenge with this red/green combo.  I like the composition although I think some miht say that you have broken the ROT with the tulip that has been placed in the centre.  For me, the high contrast light is working against you here.  The lighting makes it difficult to see and enjoy the details of the tulips and you are getting a ton of reflection from the grass, so it doesn''t look as green as it could have.  Depending on where the sun was, a polarizer might have helped, but earlier or later in the day would have helped also.  JMO.</td>', 'You definitely have met the challenge with this red/green combo.  I like the composition although I think some miht say that you have broken the ROT with the tulip that has been placed in the centre.  For me, the high contrast light is working against you here.  The lighting makes it difficult to see and enjoy the details of the tulips and you are getting a ton of reflection from the grass, so it doesn''t look as green as it could have.  Depending on where the sun was, a polarizer might have helped, but earlier or later in the day would have helped also.  JMO.', '2006-04-29 20:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2359367, 323719, 41522, '<td valign="top">Definitely fitting of the challenge.  Personally, I''m not keen of the composiion.  The strong centre placement of the flower makes for a static image, sort of drawing the eye to the centre target.  Also, it doesn''t appear that any part of the flower is in focus.  Finally, the whole in the top right corner is distracting to me.  JMO</td>', 'Definitely fitting of the challenge.  Personally, I''m not keen of the composiion.  The strong centre placement of the flower makes for a static image, sort of drawing the eye to the centre target.  Also, it doesn''t appear that any part of the flower is in focus.  Finally, the whole in the top right corner is distracting to me.  JMO', '2006-04-29 20:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2359381, 326080, 41522, '<td valign="top">Very nice complementary colours here!!  Good composition and interest DOF.  On the down side for me are all those hot pixels ...  little too distracting for me.  JMO</td>', 'Very nice complementary colours here!!  Good composition and interest DOF.  On the down side for me are all those hot pixels ...  little too distracting for me.  JMO', '2006-04-29 20:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
