(2361104, 325540, 53969, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here. The colours are great, there are no other colours that take away from the yellow and purple as in alot of other photo''s in this challenge. It''s very real and you can almost feel the textures and the coolness of the water, but it is slightly abstract aslo....Well done.</td>', 'I like the concept here. The colours are great, there are no other colours that take away from the yellow and purple as in alot of other photo''s in this challenge. It''s very real and you can almost feel the textures and the coolness of the water, but it is slightly abstract aslo....Well done.', '2006-04-30 06:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
