(2361276, 324613, 53969, '<td valign="top">I like this concept, however imo if you are going to photograph fruit, veg or any food it needs to be free of blemishes, bruises and dryed withered stems. I know it can be hard to get good produce somtimes, but it is worth it in the long run. This photo might have appeared in a maqgazine or a picture on a restraunt or supermarket wall if it didn''t have those small inperfections. Don''t get me wrong, I like this photo, I just think it could be a little better.</td>', 'I like this concept, however imo if you are going to photograph fruit, veg or any food it needs to be free of blemishes, bruises and dryed withered stems. I know it can be hard to get good produce somtimes, but it is worth it in the long run. This photo might have appeared in a maqgazine or a picture on a restraunt or supermarket wall if it didn''t have those small inperfections. Don''t get me wrong, I like this photo, I just think it could be a little better.', '2006-04-30 07:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
