(2362467, 325478, 49716, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, but could be a little sharper.  Not sure what the grey thing is, but it draws the eye away from the point of the composition.</td>', 'Clever idea, but could be a little sharper.  Not sure what the grey thing is, but it draws the eye away from the point of the composition.', '2006-04-30 13:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362472, 325162, 49716, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and colour.  <br/> <br/>I tend to ''read'' images left to right (as do many people who are brought up with left-right written language). I wonder if this would have more impact if it was flipped alond the horizontal axis?</td>', 'Excellent detail and colour.   I tend to ''read'' images left to right (as do many people who are brought up with left-right written language). I wonder if this would have more impact if it was flipped alond the horizontal axis?', '2006-04-30 13:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
