(2366214, 325871, 12268, '<td valign="top">3<br/>Hello, for what it''s worth, I voted as I did bc I found the colours here to be a bit on the dull side. I''m no expert, but perhaps a bump in hte hues to bring out the greens might increase the contrast of the complimentary colours. Also, on my computer, the focus seems a tad soft. I do like the ocmposition tho and it is certainly unlike most pix in this challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-03 22:48:48.</i></td>', '3Hello, for what it''s worth, I voted as I did bc I found the colours here to be a bit on the dull side. I''m no expert, but perhaps a bump in hte hues to bring out the greens might increase the contrast of the complimentary colours. Also, on my computer, the focus seems a tad soft. I do like the ocmposition tho and it is certainly unlike most pix in this challenge.', '2006-05-01 00:38:06.000000', '2006-05-03 23:48:48.000000', 1),
