(2373803, 324999, 12268, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of this shot. It''s sharp and unique. I think, however, I might prefer it without the bubbles as they are somewhat distracting, IMHO. Good luck in the voting!</td>', 'I really like the idea of this shot. It''s sharp and unique. I think, however, I might prefer it without the bubbles as they are somewhat distracting, IMHO. Good luck in the voting!', '2006-05-02 21:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
