(2373833, 326251, 55318, '<td valign="top">Great way to introduce color in the photo.</td>', 'Great way to introduce color in the photo.', '2006-05-02 21:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373834, 325468, 12268, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, very vibrant. the focus seems a bit soft to me on what I preceive as the focal point (the flower). I my eyes tend to go towards the more sharp parts of the pic, which are for me the tip of the leaf to the left of the pic. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Nice colours, very vibrant. the focus seems a bit soft to me on what I preceive as the focal point (the flower). I my eyes tend to go towards the more sharp parts of the pic, which are for me the tip of the leaf to the left of the pic. Good luck in the challenge!', '2006-05-02 21:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373840, 323372, 12268, '<td valign="top">the contrast of the colours are really nice, particularly with the use of the green ''negative'' space. I fear that this pic &amp; other flower pix will not fair as well in challenges. Noetheless, good luck in the voting!</td>', 'the contrast of the colours are really nice, particularly with the use of the green ''negative'' space. I fear that this pic & other flower pix will not fair as well in challenges. Noetheless, good luck in the voting!', '2006-05-02 21:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373844, 326553, 12268, '<td valign="top">Are the red toothbrush &amp; the green in its holder the complimentary colours? The techs for this shot is right on: good lighting with eact sharpness. The content seems a bit off &amp; a tad boring IMHO as the drip is hardly visibile. REgradless, good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Are the red toothbrush & the green in its holder the complimentary colours? The techs for this shot is right on: good lighting with eact sharpness. The content seems a bit off & a tad boring IMHO as the drip is hardly visibile. REgradless, good luck in the challenge!', '2006-05-02 21:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373846, 325240, 12268, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I would like to see this pic with less dof as the rest of the flower is a tad distracting from the focal point. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Nice composition. I would like to see this pic with less dof as the rest of the flower is a tad distracting from the focal point. Good luck in the challenge!', '2006-05-02 21:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373848, 325978, 57525, '<td valign="top">A tiny bit blown out, but sexy lips...</td>', 'A tiny bit blown out, but sexy lips...', '2006-05-02 21:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373900, 324309, 41650, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.</td>', 'Nice perspective.', '2006-05-02 21:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373901, 326231, 41650, '<td valign="top">Guess you forgot that this was basic editing...bummer. Would have been great just to have the one green one laying in with the red ones too.</td>', 'Guess you forgot that this was basic editing...bummer. Would have been great just to have the one green one laying in with the red ones too.', '2006-05-02 21:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373908, 325813, 41337, '<td valign="top">A contrast and saturation adjustment is holding this one back.</td>', 'A contrast and saturation adjustment is holding this one back.', '2006-05-02 21:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373933, 324402, 41337, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge however I don''t find this all that interesting to be honest. Mind you it''s not easy to make something like this interesting so that''s why getting creative in your technique is vital. One possible way to do that is to take a less than common angle say much lower so that the pin stacked on top has some height to it vs the flatness it has when shooting above it. Also, I''d move the subject that you have in focus off-center.</td>', 'Meets the challenge however I don''t find this all that interesting to be honest. Mind you it''s not easy to make something like this interesting so that''s why getting creative in your technique is vital. One possible way to do that is to take a less than common angle say much lower so that the pin stacked on top has some height to it vs the flatness it has when shooting above it. Also, I''d move the subject that you have in focus off-center.', '2006-05-02 21:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373975, 324751, 41337, '<td valign="top">Not sure how I feel about the guy in the shot but other than that wow!</td>', 'Not sure how I feel about the guy in the shot but other than that wow!', '2006-05-02 22:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373982, 325906, 41337, '<td valign="top">Perfect DOF on the bee. Sweet entry. 9!</td>', 'Perfect DOF on the bee. Sweet entry. 9!', '2006-05-02 22:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373985, 324609, 41337, '<td valign="top">LOL. How many fishes were harmed by this?</td>', 'LOL. How many fishes were harmed by this?', '2006-05-02 22:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373998, 326496, 41337, '<td valign="top">When this loads I swear the flower seems to move outward. Very nice. I like how the yellow and black are so dominant in space but the violet commands the attention. Well done. 10!</td>', 'When this loads I swear the flower seems to move outward. Very nice. I like how the yellow and black are so dominant in space but the violet commands the attention. Well done. 10!', '2006-05-02 22:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374002, 324360, 43565, '<td valign="top">Needs some orange to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Needs some orange to meet the challenge.', '2006-05-02 22:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374010, 323929, 41337, '<td valign="top">Looks like Rikki Flowers to me. :P</td>', 'Looks like Rikki Flowers to me. :P', '2006-05-02 22:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374013, 324164, 43565, '<td valign="top">I assume the center is purple (too dark on my monitor), so you have purple and yellow in the shot.  However, the orange and yellow are the most prominent.  I find the shadow distracting, and it needs something different to hold my interest (lighting, angle).</td>', 'I assume the center is purple (too dark on my monitor), so you have purple and yellow in the shot.  However, the orange and yellow are the most prominent.  I find the shadow distracting, and it needs something different to hold my interest (lighting, angle).', '2006-05-02 22:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374019, 324633, 43565, '<td valign="top">Good focus and DOF, but it doesn''t really hold my interest.  Also, while there are complementary colors they are not as obvious as I think they should be for this challenge.</td>', 'Good focus and DOF, but it doesn''t really hold my interest.  Also, while there are complementary colors they are not as obvious as I think they should be for this challenge.', '2006-05-02 22:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
