(2374033, 325410, 41337, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t notice the background was a very dark shade of blue. I take it not everyone will see that. Shame because this is a very good photo. 9!</td>', 'At first I didn''t notice the background was a very dark shade of blue. I take it not everyone will see that. Shame because this is a very good photo. 9!', '2006-05-02 22:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
