(2374860, 324225, 12268, '<td valign="top">Hey, in all honesty it does not strike me as a pleasing foto. The mask and the blue hair mostly. It seems unnatural... not sure how to put it. I bet if your model had a painted blue face with slicked back hair, thi would have scored a bit higher.<br/>Technically the shot is dead on so it''s more the feel of the shot than anything else for me.<br/>Just my 2 cents.<br/> <br/>BTW, I always think all my shots are gonna win ribbons when I enter challenges. the voting almost immediately change my mind. I chalk it up to me really being satisfied with my own work which at the end of the day is really all that matters.</td>', 'Hey, in all honesty it does not strike me as a pleasing foto. The mask and the blue hair mostly. It seems unnatural... not sure how to put it. I bet if your model had a painted blue face with slicked back hair, thi would have scored a bit higher.Technically the shot is dead on so it''s more the feel of the shot than anything else for me.Just my 2 cents. BTW, I always think all my shots are gonna win ribbons when I enter challenges. the voting almost immediately change my mind. I chalk it up to me really being satisfied with my own work which at the end of the day is really all that matters.', '2006-05-03 01:45:21.000000', NULL, 0),
