(2375169, 323929, 53814, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments and critiques. This is a purple flower in a five gallon bucket of old and separated yellow paint. The paint was stirred to create the ''leaves''.  An adjustment layer "selective colors" was used to change to orange/blue which was more dramatic than the original yellow/purple.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-03 01:45:23.</i></td>', 'Thank you all for your comments and critiques. This is a purple flower in a five gallon bucket of old and separated yellow paint. The paint was stirred to create the ''leaves''.  An adjustment layer "selective colors" was used to change to orange/blue which was more dramatic than the original yellow/purple.', '2006-05-03 02:42:53.000000', '2006-05-03 02:45:23.000000', 0),
(2375180, 326495, 43156, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your well deserved blue!</td>', 'Congrats on your well deserved blue!', '2006-05-03 02:44:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2375195, 326465, 36065, '<td valign="top">--Trading Post Comment--<br/>I really can''t see the blur, but I think that you suffered from not choosing complementary colors.  Red''s complement is green and blue''s is orange.  Either way, I like this iamge.  The composition is nicely balanced and the wodd in the middle really works well to draw the eye up and through the image.  My only ding in voting was the colors.  Still, very nice work.</td>', '--Trading Post Comment--I really can''t see the blur, but I think that you suffered from not choosing complementary colors.  Red''s complement is green and blue''s is orange.  Either way, I like this iamge.  The composition is nicely balanced and the wodd in the middle really works well to draw the eye up and through the image.  My only ding in voting was the colors.  Still, very nice work.', '2006-05-03 02:48:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2375204, 326198, 43156, '<td valign="top">Oh well, Congrats again! Ill never get tired congratulating you, try me.</td>', 'Oh well, Congrats again! Ill never get tired congratulating you, try me.', '2006-05-03 02:51:47.000000', NULL, 0),
