(2375341, 325616, 17126, '<td valign="top">yeah, seems a bit low. whatever. i got paid for the shoot, and a variation of this photo will be in a magazine, along with another 11 pages and a cover shot for the magazine''s swimsuit edition. Can''t name the magazine, nor do I feel the need to validate my claim, so there.<br/> <br/>:)<br/> <br/>I guess what I''m saying is, take your 4.8 and STICK IT! lol</td>', 'yeah, seems a bit low. whatever. i got paid for the shoot, and a variation of this photo will be in a magazine, along with another 11 pages and a cover shot for the magazine''s swimsuit edition. Can''t name the magazine, nor do I feel the need to validate my claim, so there. :) I guess what I''m saying is, take your 4.8 and STICK IT! lol', '2006-05-03 03:45:50.000000', NULL, 0),
