(2375862, 326465, 53147, '<td valign="top">I gave a 6 on this one. I liked the minimalist approach but would have preffered a bit more clarity on the wood. I figure the letters on the blue side were not intentional and if in advanced editing they would be gone. Overall it was a good shot. Good colors and the angle works well. Lack of "Wow" factor hurt it. Now if you had a chameleon walking on that log...<br/> <br/>(quick read of lower comments - I do see cc with blue and orange)</td>', 'I gave a 6 on this one. I liked the minimalist approach but would have preffered a bit more clarity on the wood. I figure the letters on the blue side were not intentional and if in advanced editing they would be gone. Overall it was a good shot. Good colors and the angle works well. Lack of "Wow" factor hurt it. Now if you had a chameleon walking on that log... (quick read of lower comments - I do see cc with blue and orange)', '2006-05-03 07:44:49.000000', NULL, 0),
