(2377084, 325401, 50578, '<td valign="top">I sort of messed up this one. When I didn''t read or maybe understand the rules properly.  I thought any 2 of the 6 colors was the gig.  The center of the flower is somewhat purple but the photo hardly expresses that.  I was mostly happy that I got a shot in focus  the wind was really messing with me that day.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the nice comments, I had more votes above 5 than below by a slim margin  but thats better than the other way around. So thanks for the votes also.</td>', 'I sort of messed up this one. When I didn''t read or maybe understand the rules properly.  I thought any 2 of the 6 colors was the gig.  The center of the flower is somewhat purple but the photo hardly expresses that.  I was mostly happy that I got a shot in focus  the wind was really messing with me that day. Thanks for the nice comments, I had more votes above 5 than below by a slim margin  but thats better than the other way around. So thanks for the votes also.', '2006-05-03 12:52:08.000000', NULL, 0),
