(2377967, 324947, 38496, '<td valign="top">love the colors in this.  Maybe if it was split more in thirds it would have had a little more impact.  Lovely picture, though.</td>', 'love the colors in this.  Maybe if it was split more in thirds it would have had a little more impact.  Lovely picture, though.', '2006-05-03 15:56:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2377988, 326465, 52336, '<td valign="top">I know you''ve heard it already, but it really looks like red and blue.  I would have gone for a pristine look on the blue portion (I think I see scratches on that surface, maybe from where you were positioning the wood).  Focus is a little soft, even with USM.  At lower left, I think I see a hard line of shadow beneath the wood, which kind of detracts for me.  It''s an interesting composition nonetheless.</td>', 'I know you''ve heard it already, but it really looks like red and blue.  I would have gone for a pristine look on the blue portion (I think I see scratches on that surface, maybe from where you were positioning the wood).  Focus is a little soft, even with USM.  At lower left, I think I see a hard line of shadow beneath the wood, which kind of detracts for me.  It''s an interesting composition nonetheless.', '2006-05-03 15:59:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378016, 325631, 52336, '<td valign="top">It''s a tad lacking in focus, both compositionally and photographically.  I can see how the flowers seem to be growing from the direction of the lower right corner to the lower left.  Perhaps if you had pulled the frame back a bit to show more of this, the effect would have been better.  As well, the complementing nature of the colours isn''t effectively emphasized with the background you selected.  Pretty overall though. :)</td>', 'It''s a tad lacking in focus, both compositionally and photographically.  I can see how the flowers seem to be growing from the direction of the lower right corner to the lower left.  Perhaps if you had pulled the frame back a bit to show more of this, the effect would have been better.  As well, the complementing nature of the colours isn''t effectively emphasized with the background you selected.  Pretty overall though. :)', '2006-05-03 16:04:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378050, 325889, 52336, '<td valign="top">Awesome "wow" on first view, the colours really doing a lot to enhance the unusually shaped leaves.  Very nice image.  The white element at top right is unfortunate, and detracts for me.  Had that not been there, the effect would have been really superior.  Compositionally well done, the red leaves leading our eye up through the centre perfectly.</td>', 'Awesome "wow" on first view, the colours really doing a lot to enhance the unusually shaped leaves.  Very nice image.  The white element at top right is unfortunate, and detracts for me.  Had that not been there, the effect would have been really superior.  Compositionally well done, the red leaves leading our eye up through the centre perfectly.', '2006-05-03 16:13:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378069, 326499, 43714, '<td valign="top">This is so creative and the colours are superb!</td>', 'This is so creative and the colours are superb!', '2006-05-03 16:20:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2378075, 326495, 58014, '<td valign="top">I love this!  I  am sitting in the back of a bunch of middle school student in Texas and this really connects us with the other side of the earth.  I love the colors.   You inspire me..Judy</td>', 'I love this!  I  am sitting in the back of a bunch of middle school student in Texas and this really connects us with the other side of the earth.  I love the colors.   You inspire me..Judy', '2006-05-03 16:22:45.000000', NULL, 0),
