(2378943, 326198, 34938, '<td valign="top">As my New Zealand friend says, CHOICE. Anothes ribbon...I have a great idea for special conditions on an upcoming challenge: "If your username is kiwiness, you cannot enter"...just kidding!!! you make us all want to do better...lovely shot by the way. Love your explanation and the feeling you still have about winning these darn eluive things...you are an asset, don''t hold back, don''t ever NOT enter just because you might win another ribbon.</td>', 'As my New Zealand friend says, CHOICE. Anothes ribbon...I have a great idea for special conditions on an upcoming challenge: "If your username is kiwiness, you cannot enter"...just kidding!!! you make us all want to do better...lovely shot by the way. Love your explanation and the feeling you still have about winning these darn eluive things...you are an asset, don''t hold back, don''t ever NOT enter just because you might win another ribbon.', '2006-05-03 19:24:11.000000', NULL, 0),
