(2385582, 326491, 29490, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what the gomers who voted below 5 were thinking, this is a definite top 10 photo.  I think more bright/sat on the colors may have helped ... maybe no black line between them as well.  And maybe no sunglasses, but I''d have to see.<br/> <br/>In any case - exceptional photo.  Voters suck.</td>', 'I don''t know what the gomers who voted below 5 were thinking, this is a definite top 10 photo.  I think more bright/sat on the colors may have helped ... maybe no black line between them as well.  And maybe no sunglasses, but I''d have to see. In any case - exceptional photo.  Voters suck.', '2006-05-05 17:16:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2385699, 326491, 50231, '<td valign="top">You were robbed Shermy! This is awesome!</td>', 'You were robbed Shermy! This is awesome!', '2006-05-05 18:10:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2386004, 325813, 30454, '<td valign="top">Margie, Greetings from your own Critique Club.<br/> <br/>Here is what I like about the image.<br/> <br/>- Nice sunset picture.<br/>- Nice composition, nice moon, nice colors<br/> <br/>Here is what I think would have improved the image IMO <br/> <br/>- Was the picture taken hand held? I can see the trees are not in focus, so I believe you did not use tripod. If you use tripod, you can even go 2 stops down on the shutter speed to make this perfect.<br/>- Little more contrast / saturation in colors would be good. More saturation will bring Blue and Orange complementary colors to meet the challenge.<br/> <br/>Best of luck for the future entires.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-07 23:53:45.</i></td>', 'Margie, Greetings from your own Critique Club. Here is what I like about the image. - Nice sunset picture.- Nice composition, nice moon, nice colors Here is what I think would have improved the image IMO  - Was the picture taken hand held? I can see the trees are not in focus, so I believe you did not use tripod. If you use tripod, you can even go 2 stops down on the shutter speed to make this perfect.- Little more contrast / saturation in colors would be good. More saturation will bring Blue and Orange complementary colors to meet the challenge. Best of luck for the future entires.', '2006-05-05 20:51:12.000000', '2006-05-08 00:53:45.000000', 0),
(2386030, 326395, 10818, '<td valign="top">Its an awesome photo.  I dont consider this a chiche, thats just me.  Tough contest. 7.2 wow...great score, great job.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Its an awesome photo.  I dont consider this a chiche, thats just me.  Tough contest. 7.2 wow...great score, great job. ', '2006-05-05 21:00:09.000000', NULL, 0),
