x allowance.  Lastly as far as your title goes I noticed a few didn''t think it was interesting enough even though I thought it fit well.  The only alternative I could come up with would be "Complements of Sandgate Bay" or wherever the name of this specific pier is.  I hope this was helpful and if you have anymore questions or think some of my comments are completely wrong and want to let me know about feel free to PM me.  Personally I thought this would ribbon and finding things about I didn''t like was very difficult for me.   Great critique, much appreciated.', '2006-05-10 03:38:29.000000', NULL, 0),
