(2412157, 326330, 15711, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I didn''t comment on this during the challenge. I had given it an 8. It is stunning and the golden reds of the earth against the sky - wow.  The diagonal lines of the tree really complete this image.  Wonderfully done. Congratulations on your high placement.</td>', 'I can''t believe I didn''t comment on this during the challenge. I had given it an 8. It is stunning and the golden reds of the earth against the sky - wow.  The diagonal lines of the tree really complete this image.  Wonderfully done. Congratulations on your high placement.', '2006-05-13 13:11:54.000000', NULL, 0),
