(2469345, 325966, 27767, '<td valign="top">I love the strong colors in this shot, and I think the composition works very well. The silver dots running along the ridges are so neat. I like the sharp focus and excellent smooth lighting over the whole image.</td>', 'I love the strong colors in this shot, and I think the composition works very well. The silver dots running along the ridges are so neat. I like the sharp focus and excellent smooth lighting over the whole image.', '2006-05-30 20:09:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2476140, 324947, 27767, '<td valign="top">I think the colors in this shot are so strong. I love your title too :) hehehe, it does appear it was popular in the voting. I like the even lighting without harsh shadows. My only suggestion would be to increase the DOF so that the closest petals to the camera were also in sharp focus. Great job :)</td>', 'I think the colors in this shot are so strong. I love your title too :) hehehe, it does appear it was popular in the voting. I like the even lighting without harsh shadows. My only suggestion would be to increase the DOF so that the closest petals to the camera were also in sharp focus. Great job :)', '2006-06-01 14:31:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2482406, 323773, 46477, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! Strong saturation, great DOF and composition!<br/>Congrats</td>', 'Fantastic! Strong saturation, great DOF and composition!Congrats', '2006-06-03 22:46:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2486862, 326217, 51386, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a cool shot. Definitely was true to the challenge, and I think it is a shame that it didnt do better. I like the fact that you rotated the shot, because it gives it the appearance of smoke or something. Great idea!</td>', 'Wow, what a cool shot. Definitely was true to the challenge, and I think it is a shame that it didnt do better. I like the fact that you rotated the shot, because it gives it the appearance of smoke or something. Great idea!', '2006-06-05 15:35:04.000000', NULL, 0),
