(2492255, 324424, 21816, '<td valign="top">It looks outside!! :)<br/> <br/>The fence is a real distraction in this image. The contrast between the green grass and orange/red batters plate works really well for the challenge and you''ve avoided blowing highlights in the sky but it''s just that fence. Maybe a different angle to shoot from may of helped up your score a bit. Keep it up!</td>', 'It looks outside!! :) The fence is a real distraction in this image. The contrast between the green grass and orange/red batters plate works really well for the challenge and you''ve avoided blowing highlights in the sky but it''s just that fence. Maybe a different angle to shoot from may of helped up your score a bit. Keep it up!', '2006-06-07 00:43:31.000000', NULL, 0),
